                ),
                new (
                    "00TQx00000PjuENMAZ",
                    new UNOPSInteraction
                    {
                        Name = "Email: Re: Snihurivka",
                        Type = InteractionType.Email,
                        Date = DateTime.Parse("2025-05-28").ToUniversalTime(),
                        Subject = "Email: Re: Snihurivka",
                        Description = "To: sahadn@um.dk\nCC: sungud@um.dk; annkah@um.dk; massimodi@unops.org; arunn@unops.org; eleneag@unops.org; marysiaz@unops.org; naimoh@unops.org; vadyms@unops.org; valentynp@unops.org\nBCC: \nAttachment: --none--\n\nSubject: Re: Snihurivka\nBody:\nDear Sahil\nThank you very much for your availability. I have sent an invite for an online meeting via Google Meet. I hope the platform works on your end. \nIn the calendar invite I have included the preliminary assessment of the reconstruction of the Snihurivka high school as a basis for our dialogue. If time permits, perhaps we could also touch upon next steps for the reconstruction of the Arkas High school. For ease of reference, I have therefore also included a brief concept note from January on the full reconstruction of the Arkas High School in the calendar invite. \nBest regards,Asbjørn\n\nOn Tue, 27 May 2025 at 15:52, Sahil Adnan <sahadn@um.dk> wrote:\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nDear Asbjørn,\n\n \nLooking forward to working with you and the rest of the UNOPS colleagues.\n\n \nI am available on the 4th between 11:30 – 13:30 and then again between 14:30-16.00.\n\n \nWill you send a link for the meeting?\n\n \nBest,\n\n\nSahil  \n \n\n\nFra: Asbjorn BRINK <asbjornb@unops.org>\n\n\nSendt: 26 May 2025 15:26\n\nTil: Sune Hjelmervik Gudnitz <sungud@um.dk>\n\nCc: Anne Kahl <annkah@um.dk>; Massimo DIANA <massimodi@unops.org>; Arun NARAYANAN <arunn@unops.org>; Elene AGLADZE <eleneag@unops.org>; Vadym SHCHEDRIN <vadyms@unops.org>; Vladyslav Kyrii <vladyslavk@unops.org>; Marysia ZAPASNIK <marysiaz@unops.org>;\n Valentyn POVROZNYUK <valentynp@unops.org>; Teresa MOLERO RODRIGUEZ <teresam@unops.org>; Naimo HASSAN HIRSI <naimoh@unops.org>; Sahil Adnan <sahadn@um.dk>\n\nEmne: Re: Snihurivka\n\n\n \n[CAUTION - EXTERNAL EMAIL] This email was sent from outside the MFA organisation. DO NOT reply, click on links, or open attachments unless you have verified\n the sender and know the content is safe.\n\n\n\nDear Sune,\n\n\n \n\n\nThank you for your feedback - and a huge thanks for the excellent and constructive collaboration during your time at EUNABO. It has been an absolutely undivided pleasure to work\n with you. I know that I say this on behalf of all my colleagues at UNOPS, who have all been very impressed with your always relevant and helpful comments, suggestions and approach which we have all truly appreciated during our collaboration.  \n\n\n \n\n\nI wish you all the best in your new endeavours and hope our paths cross again. \n\n\n \n\n\n \n\n\nDear Sahil,\n\n\n \n\n\nWelcome to the team! Myself and the entire team at UNOPS look very much forward to working with you - and continuing the constructive, pragmatic and solution oriented collaboration\n we have between Denmark and UNOPS in Ukraine. \n\n\n \n\n\nMight you be available to meet online at your convenience on June 4 or 5 to discuss next steps for Arkas and Snihurivka? \n\n\n \n\n\nThank you in advance. \n\n\n \n\n\nBest,\n\n\nAsbjørn\n\n\n  \n\n \n\n\nOn Mon, 26 May 2025 at 13:36, Sune Hjelmervik Gudnitz <sungud@um.dk> wrote:\n\n\n\n\n\nDear Asbjørn\n \nMany thanks to you and your colleagues for producing this preliminary assessment. It provides a sound\n and detailed overview of the tasks at hand and the way forward. To that end, we would like to explore further along these lines together with UNOPS.\n\n \nI will be handing over my UNOPS responsibilities to my colleague Sahil in connection with my transfer\n to our Permanent Mission in Geneva on 1 June. I therefore propose to set up a meeting directly with Sahil to agree on the next steps in regards to this project as well as Arkas. I’m of course happy to participate in the meeting if it can be of any help with\n regards to continuity. \n \nBest regards,\nSune\n\n_______________________________________________________\n\nSUNE HJELMERVIK GUDNITZ /\nSUNGUD@UM.DK\n\nCHIEF ADVISOR\n\nEUROPEAN NEIGHBOURHOOD / UKRAINE RECONSTRUCTION\n\nDIRECT +4533920639\n\n\nMOBILE +4523725319\n\n \n\nMINISTRY OF FOREIGN AFFAIRS, DENMARK\n\nASIATISK PLADS 2 / DK-1448 COPENHAGEN K\n\n/\nWWW.UM.DK\n\nHOW\n WE PROCESS PERSONAL INFORMATION\n\n \n\n\n\nPlease\n consider the environment before printing this message\n\n \n \n \n \n \n\n\nFrom: Asbjorn BRINK <asbjornb@unops.org>\n\n\nSent: 23 May 2025 14:58\n\nTo: Anne Kahl <annkah@um.dk>; Sune Hjelmervik Gudnitz <sungud@um.dk>\n\nCc: Massimo DIANA <massimodi@unops.org>; Arun NARAYANAN <arunn@unops.org>; Elene AGLADZE <eleneag@unops.org>;\n Vadym SHCHEDRIN <vadyms@unops.org>; Vladyslav Kyrii <vladyslavk@unops.org>; Marysia ZAPASNIK <marysiaz@unops.org>;\n Valentyn POVROZNYUK <valentynp@unops.org>; Teresa MOLERO RODRIGUEZ <teresam@unops.org>; Naimo HASSAN HIRSI <naimoh@unops.org>\n\nSubject: Snihurivka\n\n\n \n[CAUTION - EXTERNAL EMAIL] This email was sent from outside the MFA organisation. DO NOT reply, click on links, or open attachments unless you have verified\n the sender and know the content is safe.\n\n\n\nDear Sune and Anne,\n\n\n \n\n\nPlease find attached as agreed a preliminary assessment of the reconstruction of the Snihurivka school based on site visits and provided documentation.\n\n\n \n\n\nMight you - and your relevant colleagues - be available to meet online on June 4 or 5 so that our team can present findings, estimates and discuss the way forward? \n\n\n \n\n\nThank you in advance and have a good weekend when you get there. \n\n\n \n\n\nBest,\n\n\nAsbjørn\n\n\n \n\n\n \n\n--\n\n\n\n \n\nAsbjørn Brink| Head of Northern Europe Liaison Office | Partnerships and Liaison Group\n | HQ | Copenhagen, Denmark | Tel: +45 40 80 36 54 | Follow\n us on social media and\nsubscribe\n to our newsletter. | www.unops.org\n\n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n-- \n\n\n\n \n\nAsbjørn Brink| Head of Northern Europe Liaison Office | Partnerships and Liaison Group\n | HQ | Copenhagen, Denmark | Tel: +45 40 80 36 54 | Follow\n us on social media and\nsubscribe\n to our newsletter. | www.unops.org\n\n\n\n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n-- \n\nAsbjørn Brink| Head of Northern Europe Liaison Office | Partnerships and Liaison Group | HQ | Copenhagen, Denmark | Tel: +45 40 80 36 54 | Follow us on social media and subscribe to our newsletter. | www.unops.org",
