                        Type = InteractionType.Email,
                        Date = DateTime.Parse("2025-05-02").ToUniversalTime(),
                        Subject = "Email: Re: Thank you et merci",
                        Description = "To: manuel.etter@eda.admin.ch\nCC: louisel@unops.org; martin.borgeaud@eda.admin.ch; andrewk@unops.org; guillaumele@unops.org\nBCC: \nAttachment: --none--\n\nSubject: Re: Thank you et merci\nBody:\nDear Manuel, Martin, \nThank you also from my side- I much appreciated you taking the time to welcome us and discuss. Martin, special thanks goes to you for all the support on advancing the revised framework agreement! We look forward to meeting Melina to continue our close cooperation. \nBest regards also to Rea, Claudia and the team, \nFreya\n\nOn Fri, May 2, 2025 at 8:04 AM Etter Lindegger Manuel EDA ETM <manuel.etter@eda.admin.ch> wrote:\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nDear Louise\n \nThank you for your kind words. It was a pleasure to welcome the UNOPS delegation here in Zollikofen and we look forward to the continued\n collaboration and dialogue. \n \nMartin’s successor Ms Melina Papageorgiou will join our team in August and indeed Martin will ensure a smooth handover and introduction\n with UNOPS. \n \nWishing you, Freya and the UNOPS team a nice weekend ahead,\nBest regards\n \nManu\n \n\nManuel Etter\nHead of UN & MDB\nDeputy Head of Multilateral Affairs & NGO\n \nFederal Department of Foreign Affairs FDFA\nSwiss Agency for Development and Cooperation SDC\n\nMultilateral Affairs & NGO Division / UN & MDB Section\nEichenweg 5, Zollikofen, 3003 Berne\nTel.: +41 58 462 63 28\nMob.: +41 78 806 45 07\nTel.: +41 58 462 36 63 (secretariat)\n \ne-mail:\nmanuel.etter@eda.admin.ch\nwww.sdc-multilateral.ch\nhttps://www.sdc.admin.ch\n \n\n \n\nFrom: Louise LEECH <louisel@unops.org>\n\n\nSent: Thursday, May 1, 2025 6:38 PM\n\nTo: Etter Lindegger Manuel EDA ETM <manuel.etter@eda.admin.ch>; Borgeaud Martin EDA BORGM <martin.borgeaud@eda.admin.ch>\n\nCc: Freya von GROOTE <FreyaVG@unops.org>\n\nSubject: [EXTERNAL] Thank you et merci\n\n \n\n\nDear Manu, Martin and SDC colleagues (please pass on :)\n\n\n\n \n\n\nThank you for the warm welcome and productive dialogue in Bern yesterday.\n\n\nIt was a pleasure to meet with you in person, which is always the preferable mode!\n\n\nWe appreciate SDC support, transparency and ongoing engagement in UNOPS transformation journey and your collaboration.\n\n\nWe look forward to maintaining strong collaboration as we all move forward in an increasingly challenging development environment.\n\n\n\nFreya and I will rely on Martin's good grace to introduce his replacement in the coming weeks and we look forward to a smooth transition. Copying Freya here so you will be in contact going forward.\n\n\n\nThanks again and wishing you a restful end of the week.\n\n\n \n\n\n\n\n\nWith thanks and best wishes\n\nLouise\n\nLouise Leech, MPH\n| Head, Geneva Liaison Office | Partnerships and Liaison Group | Geneva, Switzerland | Tel: +41 79 343 1614|\nFollow us\n on social media and subscribe\n to our newsletter. | www.unops.org\n\n\n\n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n-- \nFreya von Groote Director | Partnership and Liaison Group a.i. | UNOPS Headquarters| Copenhagen, Denmark Tel/WhatsApp: +45 30177549 | Follow us on social media and subscribe to our newsletter. | www.unops.org\n\n-- \nFreya von Groote Director | Partnership and Liaison Group a.i. | UNOPS Headquarters| Copenhagen, Denmark Tel/WhatsApp: +45 30177549 | Follow us on social media and subscribe to our newsletter. | www.unops.org",
                        Location = null,
