                    {
                        Name = "Email: Re: Request for joint presentation - IFAD UNOPS learning session - 9 April 2025",
                        Type = InteractionType.Email,
                        Date = DateTime.Parse("2025-04-07").ToUniversalTime(),
                        Subject = "Email: Re: Request for joint presentation - IFAD UNOPS learning session - 9 April 2025",
                        Description = "To: a.turinayo@ifad.org; i.cisse@ifad.org; y.kumar@ifad.org; adamada@unops.org\nCC: m.peltola@ifad.org; m.cortadellasmancini@ifad.org; juyoungl@unops.org; martina@unops.org\nBCC: \nAttachment: --none--\n\nSubject: Re: Request for joint presentation - IFAD UNOPS learning session - 9 April 2025\nBody:\nDear Tonton\n\nPlease see revised presentation as per your suggestions.\n\nKind regards,\n\nSafiatou\n\n\nFrom: Cisse, Ibrahima Tonton <i.cisse@ifad.org>\n\nSent: Monday, April 7, 2025 7:24 AM\n\nTo: Kumar, Yukta <y.kumar@ifad.org>; Bah, Safiatou <sa.bah@ifad.org>; Adama DAOU <adamada@unops.org>; Djibrilla MAZIN <djibrillama@unops.org>; TURINAYO, ANN <a.turinayo@ifad.org>\n\nCc: Peltola, Maija <m.peltola@ifad.org>; Cortadellas Mancini, Marc <m.cortadellasmancini@ifad.org>; Juyoung LEE <juyoungl@unops.org>; Martin AREVALO <martina@unops.org>\n\nSubject: RE: Request for joint presentation - IFAD UNOPS learning session - 9 April 2025\n \n\n\n\n\n\nDear Safiatou,\n \nHope you’re doing very well.\nThanks a million for timely submission of the draft PPt for the upcoming session. Just reviewed it and have added some comments that can help improve it a little bit. Should you need additional support,\n please feel free to contact me this afternoon. I can make myself available.\n \n\nKind regards,\nIbrahima\n\n \n\n\nFrom: Kumar, Yukta <y.kumar@ifad.org>\n\n\nSent: 04 April 2025 17:10\n\nTo: Bah, Safiatou <sa.bah@ifad.org>; Adama DAOU <adamada@unops.org>; Djibrilla MAZIN <djibrillama@unops.org>; TURINAYO, ANN <a.turinayo@ifad.org>\n\nCc: Peltola, Maija <m.peltola@ifad.org>; Cisse, Ibrahima Tonton <i.cisse@ifad.org>; Cortadellas Mancini, Marc <m.cortadellasmancini@ifad.org>; Juyoung LEE <juyoungl@unops.org>; Martin AREVALO <martina@unops.org>\n\nSubject: RE: Request for joint presentation - IFAD UNOPS learning session - 9 April 2025\n\n\n \nDear Safiatou,\n \nThanks for sending this forward. We will come back with feedback on Monday.\n\n \nBest wishes,\n \nYukta\n \n\n\nFrom: Bah, Safiatou <sa.bah@ifad.org>\n\n\nSent: 03 April 2025 20:07\n\nTo: Kumar, Yukta <y.kumar@ifad.org>; Adama DAOU <adamada@unops.org>; Djibrilla MAZIN <djibrillama@unops.org>; TURINAYO, ANN <a.turinayo@ifad.org>\n\nCc: Peltola, Maija <m.peltola@ifad.org>; Cisse, Ibrahima Tonton <i.cisse@ifad.org>; Cortadellas Mancini, Marc <m.cortadellasmancini@ifad.org>;\n Juyoung LEE <juyoungl@unops.org>; Martin AREVALO <martina@unops.org>\n\nSubject: Re: Request for joint presentation - IFAD UNOPS learning session - 9 April 2025\n\n\n \n\nDear Yukta\n\n\nPlease see attached joint presentation for operations in Guinea. Please do share with us your feedback on the presentation.\n\n\nMany thanks and kind regards\n\n\nSafiatou\n\n\n \n\n\n\n\n\nFrom: Kumar, Yukta <y.kumar@ifad.org>\n\nSent: Thursday, April 3, 2025 9:15 AM\n\nTo: Adama DAOU <adamada@unops.org>; Djibrilla MAZIN <djibrillama@unops.org>; Olinga Biwole, Joseph Rostand <j.olingabiwole@ifad.org>;\n Bah, Safiatou <sa.bah@ifad.org>; TURINAYO, ANN <a.turinayo@ifad.org>\n\nCc: Peltola, Maija <m.peltola@ifad.org>; Cisse, Ibrahima Tonton <i.cisse@ifad.org>; Cortadellas Mancini, Marc <m.cortadellasmancini@ifad.org>;\n Juyoung LEE <juyoungl@unops.org>; Martin AREVALO <martina@unops.org>\n\nSubject: RE: Request for joint presentation - IFAD UNOPS learning session - 9 April 2025\n\n\n \n\n\n\n\nDear colleagues,\n \nGentle reminder to send forward the country presentations by COB Friday 4 April allowing us to review and revert with any queries early next week.\n \nBest wishes,\n \nYukta\n \n\n\nFrom: Kumar, Yukta\n\n\nSent: 28 March 2025 09:59\n\nTo: Adama DAOU <adamada@unops.org>\n\nCc: Djibrilla MAZIN <djibrillama@unops.org>; Assande, Brou Arsene <b.assande@ifad.org>; Adama DAOU <adamad@unops.org>; Olinga Biwole,\n Joseph Rostand <j.olingabiwole@ifad.org>; Bah, Safiatou <sa.bah@ifad.org>; TURINAYO, ANN <a.turinayo@ifad.org>; Genevieve LEFEBVRE <genevievel@unops.org>;\n Martin AREVALO <martina@unops.org>; Juyoung LEE <juyoungl@unops.org>; Cortadellas Mancini, Marc <m.cortadellasmancini@ifad.org>;\n Cisse, Ibrahima Tonton <i.cisse@ifad.org>; Peltola, Maija <m.peltola@ifad.org>\n\nSubject: RE: Request for joint presentation - IFAD UNOPS learning session - 9 April 2025\n\n\n \nDear colleagues,\n \nThank you all for responding in a timely manner. We can now confirm joint country presentations from Guinea and Madagascar. Burkina Faso team has prior commitments and will be on mission during that time\n so have sent forward feedback to be shared but are unable to present. \n \nPlease find attached an updated session concept note, which will go out as part of invitations to IFAD and UNOPS regional divisions, country teams and other interested operational staff.\n\n \nWe request Guinea and Madagascar to please share the joint presentations (template attached) by\nCOB Friday 4 April 2025 to help us pull this all together for the event.\n \nWe truly appreciate the participation in this learning session to support improved collaboration and look forward to hearing from you soon.\n\n \nBest wishes,\n \nYukta\n \n\n\nFrom: Adama DAOU <adamada@unops.org>\n\n\nSent: 27 March 2025 12:56\n\nTo: Kumar, Yukta <y.kumar@ifad.org>\n\nCc: Djibrilla MAZIN <djibrillama@unops.org>; Assande, Brou Arsene <b.assande@ifad.org>; Adama DAOU <adamad@unops.org>; Olinga Biwole,\n Joseph Rostand <j.olingabiwole@ifad.org>; Bah, Safiatou <sa.bah@ifad.org>; TURINAYO, ANN <a.turinayo@ifad.org>; Genevieve LEFEBVRE <genevievel@unops.org>;\n Martin AREVALO <martina@unops.org>; Juyoung LEE <juyoungl@unops.org>; Cortadellas Mancini, Marc <m.cortadellasmancini@ifad.org>;\n Cisse, Ibrahima Tonton <i.cisse@ifad.org>; Peltola, Maija <m.peltola@ifad.org>\n\nSubject: Re: Request for joint presentation - IFAD UNOPS learning session - 9 April 2025\n\n\n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nYou don't often get email from\nadamada@unops.org. \nLearn why this is important \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nThis email originates from outside of IFAD. Please be extra vigilant before you click on a link, open attachments or reply.\n\n\n\n\nDear  Kumar , \n\n\nI trust you are doing well,   \n\n\nI confirm my availability and the PM to present together with IFAD for Guinea , Thanks\n\n\nAdama \n\n\n \n\n\nThank you. \n\n\n \n\n\nLe jeu. 27 mars 2025 à 11:41, Kumar, Yukta <y.kumar@ifad.org> a écrit :\n\n\n\n\n\nDear all,\n \nGentle reminder to please confirm availability today to present at the learning session to enable us to send out an invite to all regional divisions and country teams of UNOPS and IFAD for participation.\n \nFor now, we are confirming Madagascar as it is a joint presentation.\n\n \nBest wishes,\n \nYukta\n \n\n\nFrom: Djibrilla MAZIN <djibrillama@unops.org>\n\n\nSent: 27 March 2025 13:32\n\nTo: Kumar, Yukta <y.kumar@ifad.org>\n\nCc: Assande, Brou Arsene <b.assande@ifad.org>; Adama DAOU <adamad@unops.org>; Olinga Biwole, Joseph Rostand <j.olingabiwole@ifad.org>;\n Bah, Safiatou <sa.bah@ifad.org>; TURINAYO, ANN <a.turinayo@ifad.org>; Genevieve LEFEBVRE <genevievel@unops.org>;\n Martin AREVALO <martina@unops.org>; Juyoung LEE <juyoungl@unops.org>; Cortadellas Mancini, Marc <m.cortadellasmancini@ifad.org>;\n Cisse, Ibrahima Tonton <i.cisse@ifad.org>; Peltola, Maija <m.peltola@ifad.org>\n\nSubject: Re: Request for joint presentation - IFAD UNOPS learning session - 9 April 2025\n\n\n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nYou don't often get email from\ndjibrillama@unops.org.\nLearn why this is important\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nThis email originates from outside of IFAD. Please be extra vigilant before you click on a link, open attachments or reply.\n\n\n\n\n\nDear Yukta, \n\n\n \n\n\nSorry for the late answer as I am currently travelling. \n\n\nI confirm my availability to present together with IFAD for Madagascar. \n\n\n \n\n\nThank you. \n\n\n \n\n\nCordially, \n\n\n \n\n\nDjibrilla \n\n\n \n\n\nDjibrilla MAZIN | Country Manager - UNOPS Madagascar  | WhatsApp : +263 78-761-5601 | www.unops.org |\n\n \n\n\nOn Tue, 25 Mar 2025, 5:40 pm Kumar, Yukta, <y.kumar@ifad.org> wrote:\n\n\n\n\nResending with correct email addresses and additional contacts:\n \nDear colleagues,\n \nWe hope you are well! Over the past months and as a follow up action to the meeting of the IFAD and UNOPS Principals in December 2024, we reached out to consult regional divisions and country teams on IFAD-UNOPS collaboration globally\n to understand the current scope of collaboration between IFAD and UNOPS and where there is interest and potential for future collaborations. There were two key findings that emerged for action:\n\n\nThere are number of existing on-going or recent collaborations with important lessons to learn from.A request from both IFAD and UNOPS country teams to understand and learn from existing collaboration experience, better understand of the scope of UNOPS offerings, and finally how to go about working together.\n \nTo that end and as part of consultations, we identified the following collaborations in Burkina Faso, Guinea, and Madagascar as important examples of IFAD and UNOPS collaboration of different kinds (implementation, infrastructure and\n procurement). We would like to request a joint presentation (IFAD+UNOPS team) on the collaboration in your context for a joint\nIFAD-UNOPS online learning session planned for Wednesday 9 April 2025 from 10:00hrs to 1200hrs CET. Please find attached the concept note and preliminary agenda for the event for your information including elements of collaboration\n to focus on. We have also attached a presentation template and structure to support the process. In terms of follow up actions:\n \n\nWe would like to request confirmation of your availability and agreement to be presenters by\nCOB Thursday 27 March 2025 so we can send out an event invitation to IFAD regional divisions and country teams, and UNOPS regional offices and country teams.\nWe request that you work together with a goal to share with us (IFAD FRU unit and UNOPS Rome) a copy of the joint presentation by\nCOB Friday 4 April 2025 to help us pull this all together for the event. \n \nWe look forward to hearing from you soon!\n \nBest wishes,\n \nYukta (on behalf of the IFAD + UNOPS organising team!)\n \nYukta Kumar\n\nSenior Specialist - Fragility\n\nFragility Unit (FRU)\nDepartment of Country Operations (DCO) Front Office\n\nVia Paolo di Dono 44, 00142 Rome, Italy\nMob:\n+39 3346030142\n\nwww.ifad.org\n\n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n \n\n \n \n~~ The information contained in or accompanying this email and any attachment thereto, is intended solely for the use of the stated recipient(s) and may contain information that is confidential and/or privileged. Any dissemination, distribution or copying\n of this email and any attachment by anyone who is not a stated recipient is strictly prohibited. If you receive this message in error, please notify the sender immediately and delete the message and any attachment from your system without retaining a copy.\n ~~",
                        Location = null,
                        GmailThreadId = null,
                        GmailMessageId = "00TQx00000OJIA8MAP",
                        EmailAddresses = new List<string> { "j.olingabiwole@ifad.org", "genevievel@unops.org", "m.peltola@ifad.org", "m.cortadellasmancini@ifad.org", "juyoungl@unops.org", "adamad@unops.org", "a.turinayo@ifad.org", "martina@unops.org", "sa.bah@ifad.org", "i.cisse@ifad.org", "djibrillama@unops.org", "y.kumar@ifad.org", "adamada@unops.org", "b.assande@ifad.org" },
