                        Description = "To: y.kumar@ifad.org\nCC: \nBCC: \nAttachment: --none--\n\nSubject: Re: Request for joint presentation - IFAD UNOPS learning session - 9 April 2025\nBody:\nThank you.She will just be at the beginning to greet.Then she must go to another meeting.\nMartín Arévalo de León | Representative and Head | Partnerships & Liaisons Group | Rome Liaison Office | Rome, Italy | Cel +39 344 778 3550 | www.unops.org Follow us on social media and subscribe to our newsletter. | www.unops.org\n\nOn Tue, Apr 8, 2025 at 10:11 AM Kumar, Yukta <y.kumar@ifad.org> wrote:\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nDear Martin,\n \nThis is well noted and while we are not able to make adjustments to the agenda as it was already shared out widely – we will create time and adjust as part of moderation.\n \nBest wishes,\n \nYukta\n \n\n\nFrom: Martin AREVALO <martina@unops.org>\n\n\nSent: 08 April 2025 10:00\n\nTo: Kumar, Yukta <y.kumar@ifad.org>\n\nCc: Cisse, Ibrahima Tonton <i.cisse@ifad.org>; Peltola, Maija <m.peltola@ifad.org>; Juyoung LEE <juyoungl@unops.org>; Elena GEORGALLA <elenage@unops.org>; Freya von GROOTE <FreyaVG@unops.org>\n\nSubject: Re: Request for joint presentation - IFAD UNOPS learning session - 9 April 2025\n\n\n \n\n\nThis email originates from outside of IFAD. Please be extra vigilant before you click on a link, open attachments or reply.\n\n\n\n\n\n\nDear Yukta and Ibrahima,\n\n\n \n\n\nOur Partnerships and Liaison Group Director, Mrs. Freya von Grotte, would like to welcome on behalf of UNOPS, IFAD attendants.\n\n\nPlease include in the programme 5 minutes for her to address the audience.\n\n\nPlease send her the meeting invitation with the link. She's copied here.\n\n\n \n\n\nfreyavg@unops.org\n\n\n \n\n\nCheers and thanks.\n\n\n \n\n\n\n\n\n\nMartín Arévalo de León\n| Representative and Head | Partnerships & Liaisons Group | Rome Liaison Office | Rome, Italy | Cel +39 344 778 3550 |\nwww.unops.org \n\nFollow us\n on social media and subscribe\n to our newsletter. | www.unops.org\n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n \n\n\nOn Tue, Mar 25, 2025 at 2:04 PM Kumar, Yukta <y.kumar@ifad.org> wrote:\n\n\n\n\n\nDear colleagues,\n \nWe hope you are well! Over the past months and as a follow up action to the meeting of the IFAD and UNOPS Principals in December 2024, we reached out to consult regional divisions\n and country teams on IFAD-UNOPS collaboration globally to understand the current scope of collaboration between IFAD and UNOPS and where there is interest and potential for future collaborations. There were two key findings that emerged for action:\n\n\n\nThere are number of existing on-going or recent collaborations with important lessons to learn from.\nA request from both IFAD and UNOPS country teams to understand and learn from existing collaboration experience, better understand of the scope of UNOPS offerings, and finally how to go about working together.\n \nTo that end and as part of consultations, we identified the following collaborations in Burkina Faso, Guinea, and Madagascar as important examples of IFAD and UNOPS collaboration\n of different kinds (implementation, infrastructure and procurement). We would like to request a joint presentation (IFAD+UNOPS team) on the collaboration in your context for a joint\nIFAD-UNOPS online learning session planned for Wednesday 9 April 2025 from 10:00hrs to 1200hrs CET. Please find attached the concept note and preliminary agenda for the event for your information including elements of collaboration\n to focus on. We have also attached a presentation template and structure to support the process. In terms of follow up actions:\n \n\n\nWe would like to request confirmation of your availability and agreement to be presenters by\nCOB Thursday 27 March 2025 so we can send out an event invitation to IFAD regional divisions and country teams, and UNOPS regional offices and country teams.\n\nWe request that you work together with a goal to share with us (IFAD FRU unit and UNOPS Rome) a copy of the joint presentation by\nCOB Friday 4 April 2025 to help us pull this all together for the event. \n\n \nWe look forward to hearing from you soon!\n \nBest wishes,\n \nYukta (on behalf of the IFAD + UNOPS organising team!)\n \nYukta Kumar\n\nSenior Specialist - Fragility\n\nFragility Unit (FRU)\nDepartment of Country Operations (DCO) Front Office\n\nVia Paolo di Dono 44, 00142 Rome, Italy\nMob:\n+39 3346030142\n\nwww.ifad.org\n\n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n \n\n \n \n~~ The information contained in or accompanying this email and any attachment thereto, is intended solely for the use of the stated recipient(s) and may contain information that is confidential and/or privileged. Any dissemination, distribution or copying\n of this email and any attachment by anyone who is not a stated recipient is strictly prohibited. If you receive this message in error, please notify the sender immediately and delete the message and any attachment from your system without retaining a copy.\n ~~",
