                        Subject = "Email: Re: WHO: SG invitation to upcoming constitutional meetings",
                        Description = "To: hqgoverningbodies@who.int; silberschmidtg@who.int\nCC: \nBCC: \nAttachment: --none--\n\nSubject: Re: WHO: SG invitation to upcoming constitutional meetings\nBody:\nDear GaudenzHope you are doing well, and great you met my colleague Tim Lardner last week!Please find attached the NV for WHA 78 next month.\nWith thanks and best wishesLouiseLouise Leech, MPH | Head, Geneva Liaison Office | Partnerships and Liaison Group | Geneva, Switzerland | Tel: +41 79 343 1614| Follow us on social media and subscribe to our newsletter. | www.unops.orgOn Mon, 7 Apr 2025 at 09:31, HQ Governing Bodies <hqgoverningbodies@who.int> wrote:\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nDear Mr Secretary-General,\n \nThe Director-General of the World Health Organization has the honour to invite you to appoint representatives to attend\n\n\n\nthe Forty-second meeting of the Programme, Budget and Administration Committee of the Executive Board (14-16 May 2025)\nthe Seventy-eighth World Health Assembly (19-27 May 2025)\nthe 157th session of the Executive Board (28-29 May 2025)\n \nThe representatives designated to attend should register in INDICO as of 14 April 2025.\n\n \nPlease find attached the notes verbales PBAC/25.3, WHA78/25.1 and EB/25.4.\n \nYours sincerely,\n \nDr Gaudenz Silberschmidt\nDirector a.i, Department of Governing Bodies\nOn behalf of the Director-General of the World Health Organization",
