                    {
                        Name = "Email: Re: Introducing new multilateral director in the Danish MFA",
                        Type = InteractionType.Email,
                        Date = DateTime.Parse("2025-02-03").ToUniversalTime(),
                        Subject = "Email: Re: Introducing new multilateral director in the Danish MFA",
                        Description = "To: kareni@um.dk\nCC: \nBCC: \nAttachment: --none--\n\nSubject: Re: Introducing new multilateral director in the Danish MFA\nBody:\nHej Karen!\nEndnu engang stort tillykke med den nye kasket! Det bliver du også super god til! \nTænkte om du havde tid og lyst til at mødes til en kop re-intro kaffe, når du lige har fået sat dig i stolen? Jeg kommer gerne forbi Asiatisk Plads - men du er naturligvis også meget velkommen herude i FN-Byen. Lad mig endelig vide hvornår og hvornår det kunne passe dig. \nGlæder mig til at arbejde sammen med dig igen!\nBhAsbjørn\nOn Fri, 31 Jan 2025 at 12:29, Marie-Louise Koch Wegter <marweg@um.dk> wrote:\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nDear\nJorge,\n \nI am writing to inform you that I - with a bit of a short notice – will be assuming a new role as the MFAs humanitarian director as of Monday, February\n 3rd. I will be replaced by Karen Grønlund Rogne, copied in here, who comes with extensive experience in the Ministry of Foreign Affairs, including from our mission in New York.\nCEB-planning will be in very safe and competent hands with her and the UN team.\n\n \nThank you for the excellent cooperation with you and your team\n from my current position. Luckily, my new position will also offer plenty of opportunities for cooperation with UN partners, including UNOPS and the UN city – where I will actually be attending a conference already next week.\n \n  \nAll the best\n\n \nMarie-Louise\n\n \nMARIE-LOUISE WEGTER /\nMARWEG@UM.DK\nMULTILATERAL DIRECTOR\nCELL +4521365630\n \nDANISH MINISTRY OF FOREIGN AFFAIRS\nASIATISK PLADS 2 / 1448 KØBENHAVN K\nWWW.UM.DK\n \nHOW\n WE TREAT PERSONAL DATA\n \n \n \n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n-- \n\nAsbjørn Brink| Head of Northern Europe Liaison Office | Partnerships and Liaison Group | HQ | Copenhagen, Denmark | Tel: +45 40 80 36 54 | Follow us on social media and subscribe to our newsletter. | www.unops.org",
