                    {
                        Name = "Email: Laboratory Freezers - Cameroon",
                        Type = InteractionType.Email,
                        Date = DateTime.Parse("2025-01-27").ToUniversalTime(),
                        Subject = "Email: Laboratory Freezers - Cameroon",
                        Description = "To: Noah.Zahrobsky@theglobalfund.org\nCC: \nBCC: \nAttachment: --none--\n\nSubject: Laboratory Freezers - Cameroon\nBody:\nDear Noah\nThank you for your kind wishes - and I hope this finds you well also :) \nTo keep you up to date with developments on our side, UNOPS Cameroon country office sent an update to the MOH today, outlining the latest actions and follow ups (pls see attached for your further information).\nAs you know, we have been treating this matter as a top priority since we were alerted to this situation. It has been a painstaking and detailed process that we are now close to concluding.\nWe continue to do everything in our power to ensure that the freezers are replaced as soon as possible, either through the original UNOPS' supplier GRRL or through other means.  Our immediate next step is to have a final meeting with GRRL, with our Legal Group, to use the findings of the latest independent expert review, to outline the GRRL breach of contract and urge GRRL to immediately replace the freezers. \nIf UNOPS is unable to agree on a solution with GRRL at the next meeting, UNOPS will take other steps to ensure the replacement of the freezers in accordance with its contractual obligations.My country team has suggested the matter will be concluded in the coming few weeks.\nI hope this helps clarify where we are in the process relating to the 239 freezers.  Please let me know if you have any other queries in the meantime.With thanks for your ongoing collaboration,Best wishes Louise With thanks and best wishesLouiseLouise Leech, MPH | Head, Geneva Liaison Office | Partnerships and Liaison Group | Geneva, Switzerland | Tel: +41 79 343 1614| Follow us on social media and subscribe to our newsletter. | www.unops.org\n\nOn Fri, 24 Jan 2025 at 08:32, Noah Zahrobsky <Noah.Zahrobsky@theglobalfund.org> wrote:\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nThanks Louise and wishing you better health in the start to the new year.\n\n \nBest,\n\n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nNoah Zahrobsky\nSenior Fund Portfolio Manager\nAfrica and the Middle East\n\n\n\n\n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nM: +41795495410\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nnoah.zahrobsky@theglobalfund.org\n\n\n\n\ntheglobalfund.org\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n\nFrom: Louise LEECH <louisel@unops.org>\n\n\nSent: Thursday, January 23, 2025 6:18 PM\n\nTo: Noah Zahrobsky <Noah.Zahrobsky@theglobalfund.org>\n\nSubject: Re: Laboratory Freezers\n\n\n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nCAUTION: This email originated from outside of the organization. Do not click links or open attachments\n unless you recognize the sender and know the content is safe. \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nDear Noah\n\n\nhappy new year!\n\n\nApologies for delay I’ve been off sick. \n\n\nI’m getting the team To provide a comprehensive update - i will revert to you tomorrow   \n\n\nAll best wishes\n\n\nLouise\n\n\n \n\n\nOn Wed, 22 Jan 2025 at 11:48, Noah Zahrobsky <Noah.Zahrobsky@theglobalfund.org> wrote:\n\n\n\n\nDear Louise,\n\n \nI hope all is well in the new year.\n\n \nI am writing to follow up on the replacement of the laboratory freezers. I was informed by our Global Fund OIG colleagues\n that the UNOPS IAIG recently launched an official investigation and realize they are coordinating on this.\n\n \nIndependent of the investigation outcome, I would like to know when UNOPS will place the order for the freezers. We are\n preparing communication to the Minister and I either need to add the amount of the value of the freezers estimated at EUR 940K to be reimbursed or to accept that these will be replaced quickly.\n\n \nCan you please indicate if UNOPS can place this order by early February?\n \nKind regards,\n\n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nNoah Zahrobsky\nSenior Fund Portfolio Manager\nAfrica and the Middle East\n\n\n\n\n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nM: +41795495410\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nnoah.zahrobsky@theglobalfund.org\n\n\n\n\ntheglobalfund.org\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n\n\n\nGlobal Health Campus |\n\nChemin du Pommier 40 | 1218 Grand-Saconnex | Geneva, Switzerland",
                        Location = null,
                        GmailThreadId = null,
                        GmailMessageId = "00TQx00000Kp21AMAR",
