                        Date = DateTime.Parse("2025-01-16").ToUniversalTime(),
                        Subject = "Email: UNOPS & WFP, Follow-up to Discussions",
                        Description = "To: martina@unops.org; rainatou.baillet@wfp.org\nCC: elyse.inguanti@wfp.org\nBCC: \nAttachment: --none--\n\nSubject: UNOPS & WFP, Follow-up to Discussions\nBody:\nDear Martin,\n\n \nThank you for the confirmation.\n \nYour meeting with Betty and Rainatou is confirmed to take place on Monday, January 27th, at 15:15.\n\nBetty’s office is located in the Annex called Sustainability Square, on the 6th floor, room no. 22.\n\n \nThank you and regards\n \n \nFrom: Martin AREVALO \nmartina@unops.org \n\nSent: Thursday, January 16, 2025 4:00 PM\n\nTo: Hawa IANNELLO hawa.iannello@wfp.org\n\nSubject: Re: Follow-up to Discussions in November UNOPS-WFP\n \n\n\n\n\n\n\nNon ricevi spesso messaggi di posta elettronica da\nmartina@unops.org. \nScopri perché è importante \n\n\n\n\n\n\nPlease be careful when opening emails that originate from outside WFP\nDear Hawa, thank you very much.\nYes I will attend in person.\n \n\nMartín Arévalo de León\n| Representative and Head | Partnerships & Liaisons Group | Rome Liaison Office | Rome, Italy | Cel +39 344 778 3550 |\nwww.unops.org \n\nFollow us on social media\n and subscribe\n to our newsletter. | www.unops.org\n\n\n \n \nOn Wed, Jan 15, 2025 at 5:16 PM Hawa IANNELLO <hawa.iannello@wfp.org> wrote:\nDear Martin,\n \nHope you’re doing well.\n \nFor your meeting with Betty and Rainatou, I would like to suggest 3:15 PM CET on Monday, January 27th. Could you please confirm if that time works for you? I'll send an invite once\n confirmed.\n \nI see you're in Rome, will you be attending in person?\n \n \nThank you and regards\nHawa  \n\n From: Martin AREVALO <martina@unops.org>\n\n\nSent: Wednesday, January 15, 2025 4:06 PM\n\nTo: Betty KA <betty.ka@wfp.org>\n\nCc: Rainatou BAILLET <rainatou.baillet@wfp.org>; Elyse INGUANTI <elyse.inguanti@wfp.org>; Hawa IANNELLO <hawa.iannello@wfp.org>\n\nSubject: Re: Follow-up to Discussions in November UNOPS-WFP\n \n\n\n\n\n\n\nNon ricevi spesso messaggi di posta elettronica da\nmartina@unops.org. \nScopri perché è importante \n\n\n\n\n\n\nPlease be careful when opening emails that originate from outside WFP\nCheers Betty!\nGreat, send the invite, and I'm the only one for the moment to make an arrangement with.\n \nHave a great week.\n \nMartín Arévalo de León\n| Representative and Head | Partnerships & Liaisons Group | Rome Liaison Office | Rome, Italy | Cel +39 344 778 3550 |\nwww.unops.org \nFollow us\n on social media and subscribe\n to our newsletter. | www.unops.org\n\n \n \nOn Wed, Jan 15, 2025 at 3:51 PM Betty KA <betty.ka@wfp.org> wrote:\nDear Martin  \nHappy new year!\nI would be very happy to meet indeed and take our discussion to the next level.\nI’m traveling next week but we can already set a date for week after next. \nMy colleague Rainatou who’s the Chief of the Procurement service will join me. \nHawa in cc will get in touch to find an appropriate slot. \nPlease let us know who we should be making arrangements with. \n \nThanks and best \nBetty \n \nMs. Betty Ka\nDirector, Supply Chain & Delivery division \nUnited Nations World Food Programme \nCell: (39) 342 924 22 94\n \nSent from my iPhone, please excuse brevity and typos\n \nOn 15 Jan 2025, at 15:33, Martin AREVALO <martina@unops.org> wrote:\n﻿ \n\n\n\n\n\n\nYou don't often get email from\nmartina@unops.org. \nLearn why this is important \n\n\n\n\n\n\nPlease be careful when opening emails that originate from outside WFP\nDear Betty:\n \nI hope my message finds you well, and that the Holiday Season was good for you and your loved ones.\nAs the subject mentions, I would like to follow up on the discussion our EDs had in November, looking into strategically collaborating where possible, and avoiding overlapping actions.\nPlease let me know when would it be possible for you to meet.\n \nCheers,\n \nMartín Arévalo de León\n| Representative and Head | Partnerships & Liaisons Group | Rome Liaison Office | Rome, Italy | Cel +39 344 778 3550 |\nwww.unops.org \nFollow us\n on social media and subscribe\n to our newsletter. | www.unops.org\n\n\n\n________________________________________________________________________________\n\n\nMicrosoft Teams\nNeed help?\n\n\n\nJoin\n the meeting now \n\n\nMeeting ID:\n384 044 415 447\n\n\n\nPasscode:\nVY7g98SL\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nDial in by phone\n\n\n\n+39 02 3056 6777,,858888789#\nItaly, Milan\n\n\n\nFind a local number\n\n\n\n\nPhone conference ID:\n858 888 789#\n\n\n\nJoin on a video conferencing device\n\n\n\nTenant key:\nteams@wfp.onpexip.com\n\n\n\nVideo ID:\n124 168 858 8\n\n\n\nMore info\n\n\n\nFor organizers:\nMeeting\n options |\nReset dial-in PIN\n\n\n\n\nTo join the meeting via phone from any WFP office, please dial: 1301 4344, otherwise use +39 06 6513 4344\n\n\n\n________________________________________________________________________________\n\n\n \n\n\n\n\n\nThe information contained in this electronic message and any attachments is intended for specific individuals or entities, and may be confidential, proprietary or privileged. If you are not the intended recipient, please notify the sender immediately, delete\n this message and do not disclose, distribute or copy it to any third party or otherwise use this message. The content of this message does not necessarily reflect the official position of the World Food Programme. Electronic messages are not secure or error\n free and may contain viruses or may be delayed, and the sender is not liable for any of these occurrences. The sender reserves the right to monitor, record and retain electronic messages.",
