                        Description = "To: alistairs@unops.org\nCC: \nBCC: \nAttachment: --none--\n\nSubject: FW: Christine/Andy touchbase\nBody:\n \n \n\n-----Original Appointment-----\n\nFrom: Andrew C. Kircher \n\nSent: Wednesday, December 4, 2024 9:11 AM\n\nTo: Andrew C. Kircher; Christine BOWERS\n\nSubject: Christine/Andy touchbase\n\nWhen: Wednesday, December 4, 2024 2:00 PM-2:30 PM (UTC-05:00) Eastern Time (US & Canada).\n\nWhere: Microsoft Teams Meeting\n\n \n \n\n\n________________________________________________________________________________\n\n\nMicrosoft Teams\nNeed help?\n\n\n\nJoin\n the meeting now \n\n\nMeeting ID:\n240 137 677 045\n\n\n\nPasscode:\n9GR38G9g\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nDial in by phone\n\n\n\n+1 509-408-0991,,955285883#\nUnited States, Liberty Lake\n\n\n\nFind a local number\n\n\n\n\nPhone conference ID:\n955 285 883#\n\n\n\nJoin on a video conferencing device\n\n\n\nTenant key:\nwbg@m.webex.com\n\n\n\nVideo ID:\n114 651 767 5\n\n\n\nMore info\n\n\n\nFor organizers:\nMeeting\n options |\n\nReset dial-in PIN \n\n\n________________________________________________________________________________",
