                    new UNOPSInteraction
                    {
                        Name = "Email: Re: UNFPA MOU Discussion",
                        Type = InteractionType.Email,
                        Date = DateTime.Parse("2024-11-11").ToUniversalTime(),
                        Subject = "Email: Re: UNFPA MOU Discussion",
                        Description = "To: Rebecca.White@fcdo.gov.uk; stephen.berwick@fcdo.gov.uk; dahlvik@unfpa.org; linda.sloan@fcdo.gov.uk; onile-ere@unfpa.org; obezo@unfpa.org; kortekaas@unfpa.org; rhona.mcdonald@fcdo.gov.uk; Sally.Clifford@fcdo.gov.uk; Agnes.Annells@fcdo.gov.uk\nCC: rafael.martinezgil@unwomen.org; stephan.ulrich@undp.org; lbarusya@unicef.org; xiaoman.zhang@unwomen.org; ellie.young@fcdo.gov.uk; asbjornb@unops.org\nBCC: \nAttachment: --none--\n\nSubject: Re: UNFPA MOU Discussion\nBody:\nOFFICIAL\n\n\n\n\n\nDear all, \n\n\n\n\n\nThank you again for your time on Thursday. It was a really useful discussion. \n\n\n\n\n\nPlease find attached the updated DDA annex based on the conversation. I have also attached separate guidance that will be shared with FCDO programme teams setting out the due diligence process when working with the UN. If you have any additional thoughts or\n considerations on either document, please do let us know. It may also be useful to have similar guidance for your colleagues to raise any issues with the relevant UK Partnerships Lead. \n\n\n\n\n\nWe look forward to hearing about timelines for receipt of the next round of comments and anticipated agreement date. Thank you for all of your work on this to date.\n\n\n\n\n\nBest regards,\n\n\n\n\n\nGareth\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nGareth Bartlett\n| Senior Commercial Officer\n| Multilaterals\n & Grants | Grants Hub\nForeign, Commonwealth & Development Office | Abercrombie House \nE-Mail:\nGareth.Bartlett@fcdo.gov.uk\nMobile: +447917209261 \n \n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nOFFICIAL\n\n\n\nFrom: Rebecca White\n\nSent: 30 October 2024 3:41 PM\n\nTo: Rebecca White <Rebecca.White@fcdo.gov.uk>; Gareth Bartlett <Gareth.Bartlett@fcdo.gov.uk>; Stephen Berwick <stephen.berwick@fcdo.gov.uk>; Aasa Dahlvik <dahlvik@unfpa.org>; Linda Sloan <linda.sloan@fcdo.gov.uk>; Oladele Onile-Ere <onile-ere@unfpa.org>;\n Maria Monica Obezo <obezo@unfpa.org>; Vanessa Kortekaas <kortekaas@unfpa.org>; Sally Clifford <Sally.Clifford@fcdo.gov.uk>; Agnes Annells <Agnes.Annells@fcdo.gov.uk>; Rhona McDonald <rhona.mcdonald@fcdo.gov.uk>\n\nCc: Rafael Martinez Gil <rafael.martinezgil@unwomen.org>; Stephan Ulrich <stephan.ulrich@undp.org>; Leona Barusya <lbarusya@unicef.org>; Asbjorn BRINK <asbjornb@unops.org>; Xiaoman Zhang <xiaoman.zhang@unwomen.org>; Ellie Young <ellie.young@fcdo.gov.uk>\n\nSubject: UNFPA MOU Discussion\n\nWhen: 07 November 2024 15:30-16:30.\n\nWhere: Microsoft Teams Meeting; UK_AH_241_Hybrid VC (6)\n \n\n \n\n________________________________________________________________________________\n\n\nMicrosoft Teams\nNeed\n help?\n\n\nJoin\n the meeting now\n\n\nMeeting ID:\n327 534 746 922\n\n\nPasscode:\nbjiAjU\n\n\n\n\n\nDial in by phone\n\n\n+44\n 20 7660 8164,,919130001#\nUnited Kingdom, City of London\n\n\nFind\n a local number\n\n\nPhone conference ID:\n919 130 001#\n\n\nJoin on a video conferencing device\n\n\nTenant key:\nteams@fcdo2.onpexip.com\n\n\nVideo ID:\n128 187 425 3\n\n\nMore\n info\n\nFor organizers:\nMeeting\n options\n|\nReset\n dial-in PIN\n\n\nYour activity on Teams may be monitored in line with relevant UK legislation.\n\n\nPrivacy\n and security\n\n\n________________________________________________________________________________\n\n \n\n\nFollow us online: www.gov.uk/fcdo\n\n\nThis email is intended for the addressee(s) only: All messages sent and received by the Foreign, Commonwealth & Development Office may be monitored in line with relevant\n\nUK legislation",
