                new (
                    "00TQx00000HvoJMMAZ",
                    new UNOPSInteraction
                    {
                        Name = "Email: UN Fleet - UNOPS hosting vs. HR services",
                        Type = InteractionType.Email,
                        Date = DateTime.Parse("2024-11-11").ToUniversalTime(),
                        Subject = "Email: UN Fleet - UNOPS hosting vs. HR services",
                        Description = "To: jean-francoisl@unops.org\nCC: aureliear@unops.org; argitab@unops.org; lorrainea@unops.org; laurentium@unops.org; andrewk@unops.org\nBCC: \nAttachment: --none--\n\nSubject: UN Fleet - UNOPS hosting vs. HR services\nBody:\nHi Jean-Francois\nAt the request of Hans Barritt and Sonja, we (Lorraine Laurentiu and myself) are on a call with Lorraine, UNHCR and WFP discussing how to align / consolidate staff contracted to the \"UN Fleet\" initiative\nI floated the idea of hosting the UN Fleet as they are keen for it to be as independent as possible and alleviates the issue of are these people UNHCR or WFP or....no they are all UN Fleet staff\nDoes this make sense? If yes, I will set up a call with the WFP / UNHCR and legal colleagues to discuss the pros and cons of hosting vs. HR services\nThanks and best wishesLouise \nLouise Leech, MPH  | Head of Geneva Liaison Office | Partnerships and Liaison Group | Mobile: +41 79 343 1614  UNOPS / Office des Nations Unies pour les Services Unité de Gestion du Projet\nGlobal project overview here  |  Follow us on Facebook, LinkedIn, Twitter, Instagram, YouTube",
