                        Description = "To: roger.m.karlsson@gov.se; cristina.de-carvalho@sida.se\nCC: naimoh@unops.org\nBCC: \nAttachment: --none--\n\nSubject: Roadmap for the next UNOPS Strategic Plan, 2026-29\nBody:\nDear Roger and Cristina,\nPlease find attached the slides to be presented at the informal EB session on Tuesday next week regarding the process for drafting UNOPS' next strategic plan for 2026-29. \nThe slides will also be distributed via the secretariat later today along with the latest (21sr) update on the implementation of the comprehensive response plan (also attached here for your ease of reference). \nI hope this enables you to be better prepared for the informal session - and as always please do not hesitate to reach out for any questions or comments. \nBest regards,Asbjørn\nAsbjørn Brink | Head of Northern Europe Liaison Office | Partnerships and Liaison Group | UNOPS HQ | Copenhagen, Denmark | Mob: +45 40 80 36 54 | www.unops.org Keep up-to-date with UNOPS. Follow us on Facebook, LinkedIn, Twitter, Instagram, YouTube Subscribe to our external newsletter in English, French or Spanish.",
