                    new UNOPSInteraction
                    {
                        Name = "Email: Re: Fw: WUF12 Invitation Letter from Executive Director of UN-Habitat",
                        Type = InteractionType.Email,
                        Date = DateTime.Parse("2024-11-01").ToUniversalTime(),
                        Subject = "Email: Re: Fw: WUF12 Invitation Letter from Executive Director of UN-Habitat",
                        Description = "To: kajsah@unops.org\nCC: emiliep@unops.org; AmritaN@unops.org; unhabitat-oed@un.org; unhabitat-cos@un.org\nBCC: \nAttachment: --none--\n\nSubject: Re: Fw: WUF12 Invitation Letter from Executive Director of UN-Habitat\nBody:\nDear Kajsa,\n\n\n\n\n\nThe Thank You letter from UNOPS Executive Director, Mr Jorge Moreira Da Silva and the nomination from UNOPS to WUF12 ONE UN Roundtable is well received.\n\n\n\n\n\nWe look forward to meeting you in-person during WUF12.\n\nHave a lovely day!\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nBest​ regards,\nRan WANG\nAssociate Expert\nRegional Programme Division, HQ, UN-HABITAT\nMobile: +254 (0)702070067\nEmail:\nran.wang@un.org\n\n3rd level, Block 4, North wing, UN Complex\n\nNairobi, Kenya\n\nwww.unhabitat.org\n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nFrom: Kajsa Johanna HARTMAN <kajsah@unops.org>\n\nSent: 01 November 2024 15:59\n\nTo: Ran Wang <ran.wang@un.org>\n\nCc: Emilie Potvin [UNOPS] <emiliep@unops.org>; Amrita NAUL [UNOPS] <AmritaN@unops.org>\n\nSubject: Re: Fw: WUF12 Invitation Letter from Executive Director of UN-Habitat\n \n\nDear Ran,\n\n\n\nPlease find attached a thank you letter from UNOPS Executive Director, Mr Jorge Moreira Da Silva, for the invitation to the ONE UN Roundtable during WUF12.\n\n\n\nMs Émilie Potvin, UNOPS Director of Partnerships and Global Portfolios, is delighted to attend the Roundtable next week on his behalf.\n\n\n\nThank you again for the great coordination around this, we look forward to seeing you in just a few days!\n\n\n\nKind regards,\nKajsa\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nFrom: UN-Habitat Executive Office <unhabitat-oed@un.org>\n\nTo: Jorge Moreira Da Silva <jorge.moreiradasilva@un.org>\n\nCc: Jesus Salcedo Villanueva <jesus.salcedo@un.org>; Sylvia Jamgotchian <sylvia.jamgotchian@un.org>;\n Dennis Mwamati <mwamati@un.org>; Hamza Berrouane <hamza.berrouane@un.org>;\n Chikondi Ntupanyama (Affiliate) <chikondi.ntupanyama@un.org>; Ran Wang <ran.wang@un.org>\n\nSubject: WUF12 Invitation Letter from Executive Director of UN-Habitat\n \n\nDear Mr. Jorge Moreira da Silva,\n \nOn behalf of the Executive Director of UN-Habitat, please find enclosed, an invitation letter to the twelfth session of the World Urban Forum (WUF12) to be held in Cairo, Arab Republic\n of Egypt from 4-8 November 2024.\n \nThank you.\n \nBest regards,\nOffice of the Executive Director, UN-Habitat\n(+254) 20 7625555\n|\nP.O. Box 30030, GPO Nairobi, 00100 Kenya\n|\nUN Avenue Gigiri, UN Complex,\nBlk 4 North Wing, 3rd Level\n| \nunhabitat-oed@un.org\n|\nwww.unhabitat.org\n \n \n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n--\n\nKajsa Hartman\n| Partnerships Specialist | Partnerships and Liaison Group\n| UNOPS Headquarters\n| Copenhagen, Denmark |\nwww.unops.org \n\nKeep up-to-date with UNOPS. Follow us on\nFacebook,\nLinkedIn,\nTwitter,\nInstagram,\nYouTube.\n\nSubscribe to our external newsletter in English,\n\nFrench or\nSpanish.",
