                        Subject = "Email: Fwd: Fw: Thank you letter from the Executive Director",
                        Description = "To: kajsah@unops.org; emiliep@unops.org\nCC: kerriet@unops.org; dalilag@unops.org\nBCC: \nAttachment: --none--\n\nSubject: Fwd: Fw: Thank you letter from the Executive Director\nBody:\nHi Kajsa,\nIt seems UNHABITAT beat us in the follow-up to the meeting at UNGA. Please see attached.\nI trust you are taking this forward, and we stand ready to send a thank you / follow-up letter, should that be needed.\nCopying Dalila since they are based in Nairobi. \nBestAnna\nAnna Gaarde | Management Advisor |\nExecutive Office | Copenhagen, Denmark | www.unops.org | \nI choose to work flexibly and send emails outside normal office hours. There is no need to respond to my emails outside of your own hours.\n\n---------- Forwarded message ---------\nFrom: Jorge Moreira Da Silva <jorge.moreiradasilva@un.org>\nDate: Thu, Oct 24, 2024 at 11:24 AM\nSubject: Fw: Thank you letter from the Executive Director\nTo: Kerrie Tyas [UNOPS] <kerriet@unops.org>, Anna Gaarde [UNOPS] <annag@unops.org>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nSent from Outlook for iOS\n\n\nFrom: UN-Habitat Executive Office <unhabitat-oed@un.org>\n\nSent: Thursday, October 24, 2024 5:35:54 AM\n\nTo: Jorge Moreira Da Silva <jorge.moreiradasilva@un.org>\n\nCc: Michael Kariuki <michael.kariuki@un.org>\n\nSubject: Thank you letter from the Executive Director\n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nDear Mr. Jorge Moreira da Silva,\n\n \nOn behalf of the Executive Director of UN-Habitat, please find enclosed thank you letter addressed to\nyou.\n \n \nThank you.\n \nBest regards,\nOffice of the Executive Director, UN-Habitat\n(+254) 20 7625555\n|\nP.O. Box 30030, GPO Nairobi, 00100 Kenya\n|\nUN Avenue Gigiri, UN Complex,\nBlk 4 North Wing, 3rd Level\n| \nunhabitat-oed@un.org\n| www.unhabitat.org",
