                        Description = "To: kajsah@unops.org\nCC: \nBCC: \nAttachment: --none--\n\nSubject: Fw: WUF12 Invitation Letter from Executive Director of UN-Habitat\nBody:\nDear Kajsa,\n\n\n\n\n\nThis is the official invitation letter to your ED to join WUF 12 One UN Roundtable. Kindly for your feedback.\n\n\n\n\n\nBest regards,\n\nRan\n\n\nFrom: UN-Habitat Executive Office <unhabitat-oed@un.org>\n\nSent: 27 September 2024 13:41\n\nTo: Jorge Moreira Da Silva <jorge.moreiradasilva@un.org>\n\nCc: Jesus Salcedo Villanueva <jesus.salcedo@un.org>; Sylvia Jamgotchian <sylvia.jamgotchian@un.org>; Dennis Mwamati <mwamati@un.org>; Hamza Berrouane <hamza.berrouane@un.org>; Chikondi Ntupanyama (Affiliate) <chikondi.ntupanyama@un.org>; Ran Wang <ran.wang@un.org>\n\nSubject: WUF12 Invitation Letter from Executive Director of UN-Habitat\n \n\n\n\n\n\nDear Mr. Jorge Moreira da Silva,\n \nOn behalf of the Executive Director of UN-Habitat, please find enclosed, an invitation letter to the twelfth session of the World\n Urban Forum (WUF12) to be held in Cairo, Arab Republic of Egypt from 4-8 November 2024.\n \nThank you.\n \nBest regards,\nOffice of the Executive Director, UN-Habitat\n(+254) 20 7625555\n|\nP.O. Box 30030, GPO Nairobi, 00100 Kenya\n|\nUN Avenue Gigiri, UN Complex,\nBlk 4 North Wing, 3rd Level\n| \nunhabitat-oed@un.org\n|\nwww.unhabitat.org",
