                        Subject = "Email: Re: UK/UNOPS catch up",
                        Description = "To: Agnes.Annells@fcdo.gov.uk\nCC: Sally.Clifford@fcdo.gov.uk\nBCC: \nAttachment: --none--\n\nSubject: Re: UK/UNOPS catch up\nBody:\nHi Agnes\n\nUnfortunately I am off tomorrow until Monday next week. Could we schedule a call next week instead? \nBest,Asbjørn \nOn Wed, 30 Oct 2024 at 15:32, Agnes Annells <Agnes.Annells@fcdo.gov.uk> wrote:\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nHi – this is the time I’d suggested for us to catch up tomorrow. Does it work?\n \nAgnes\n\n\n________________________________________________________________________________\n\n\nMicrosoft Teams\nNeed help?\n\n\n\nJoin\n the meeting now \n\n\nMeeting ID:\n344 034 945 149\n\n\n\nPasscode:\nziogR9\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nDial in by phone\n\n\n\n+44 20 7660 8164,,299146987#\nUnited Kingdom, City of London\n\n\n\nFind a local number\n\n\n\n\nPhone conference ID:\n299 146 987#\n\n\n\nJoin on a video conferencing device\n\n\n\nTenant key:\nteams@fcdo2.onpexip.com\n\n\n\nVideo ID:\n121 453 535 9\n\n\n\nMore info\n\n\n\nFor organizers:\nMeeting\n options |\n\nReset dial-in PIN \n\n\n\n\nYour activity on Teams may be monitored in line with relevant UK legislation.\n\n\n\nPrivacy\n and security \n\n\n________________________________________________________________________________\n\n\n \n\n\n\nFollow us online: www.gov.uk/fcdo\n\n\nThis email is intended for the addressee(s) only: All messages sent and received by the Foreign, Commonwealth & Development Office may be monitored in line with relevant\n\nUK legislation",
