                        Date = DateTime.Parse("2024-10-28").ToUniversalTime(),
                        Subject = "Email: UNOPS / WHO EMRO - meeting in Cairo",
                        Description = "To: balkhyh@who.int; emiliep@unops.org\nCC: souissih@who.int; kajsah@unops.org\nBCC: \nAttachment: --none--\n\nSubject: UNOPS / WHO EMRO - meeting in Cairo\nBody:\nDear Hanan,I hope this finds you well, and apologies for the delay since our last exchange!  I can only imagine how challenging the last 8 months have been, and I continue to wish you well in your vital work. Speaking with Mike (Ryan) recently, he mentioned the weekly meetings that include Jorge Moreira da Silva UNOPS Executive Director in relation to the Gaza mechanism.\nBy way of this email I would like to introduce you to Mrs Emilie POTVIN our Regional Director of Global Portfolios, Delivery and Partnerships who will be in Cairo next week and would be delighted to meet with you if your schedule allows. \nDear EmiliePlease meet Dr Hanan Balkhy, WHOs new (and first female:) Regional Director for the Eastern Mediterranean Region, inaugurated in February 2024, Hanan's region is working with Ministries of Health of the 21 member states to accelerate health promotion and universal health coverage, prevent disease and manage health and humanitarian emergencies. \nI do hope you will be able to connect, with a view to continuing to strengthen our collaboration across the EM region.\nWith thanks and best wishesLouise \nLouise Leech, MPH  | Head of Geneva Liaison Office | Partnerships and Liaison Group | Mobile: +41 79 343 1614  UNOPS / Office des Nations Unies pour les Services Unité de Gestion du Projet\nGlobal project overview here  |  Follow us on Facebook, LinkedIn, Twitter, Instagram, YouTube \nDear Louise, thank you very much.  let's have a chat soon.  balkhyh@who.int cc souissih@who.in",
                        Location = null,
                        GmailThreadId = null,
                        GmailMessageId = "00TQx00000HRC8WMAX",
