                    "00TQx00000HJEaDMAX",
                    new UNOPSInteraction
                    {
                        Name = "Email: Re: DG ECHO Humanitarian Implementation Plan for Palestine",
                        Type = InteractionType.Email,
                        Date = DateTime.Parse("2024-10-08").ToUniversalTime(),
                        Subject = "Email: Re: DG ECHO Humanitarian Implementation Plan for Palestine",
                        Description = "To: karunah@unops.org\nCC: mariacarmenco@unops.org; laetitiak@unops.org; sophien@unops.org; rashak@unops.org; marijab@unops.org\nBCC: \nAttachment: --none--\n\nSubject: Re: DG ECHO Humanitarian Implementation Plan for Palestine\nBody:\nDear Karuna, \nThank you for reaching out, we would be happy to discuss. May I suggest we have a call next week, after the GLN? Our calendars are up to date so please feel free to send an invite for a time of your convenience. Please also include Laetitia, in CC.\nKind regards,\nCeliaCelia Keller Martínez (she/her) | Senior Partnerships and Communication Officer (OIC) | Partnerships and Liaison Group | Brussels Liaison Office | UNOPS | www.unops.org Keep up-to-date with UNOPS. Follow us on Facebook, LinkedIn, Twitter, Instagram, and YouTube. Subscribe to our external newsletter in English, French or Spanish.\n\nOn Fri, Oct 4, 2024 at 2:56 PM Karuna HERRMANN <karunah@unops.org> wrote:\nDear Carmen, dear Celia,\nThank you for sharing below and for yesterday's presentation which we followed with interest.\nI've arrived in Jerusalem very recently and had an introductory meeting with ECHO this afternoon - there are upcoming opportunities for partnering that we'd like to talk through with you, as they would likely benefit from a coordinated approach. Do let me know when might be a good time.\nVery best, KarunaKaruna Herrmann | Director | Jerusalem Office | +972 54 347 2621 | www.unops.org Keep up-to-date with UNOPS. Follow us on Twitter, LinkedIn, Facebook, Instagram and YouTube. Subscribe to our external newsletter in English, French or Spanish. \n\nOn Wed, Oct 2, 2024 at 10:53 AM Celia KELLER MARTINEZ <celiaafricak@unops.org> wrote:\nDear colleagues, \nI am writing to inform you that DG ECHO has made available a new version of the Humanitarian Implementation Plan (HIP) for Palestine, with an additional EUR 2.37m.\nKindly find attached:The HIP identifying the priority areas of intervention;The Technical Annex containing the financial, administrative, and operational information, as well as contact points. Please feel free to share internally and do not hesitate to reach out if you have any questions.\n\nKind regards,\nCeliaCelia Keller Martínez (she/her) | Senior Partnerships and Communication Officer (OIC) | Partnerships and Liaison Group | Brussels Liaison Office | UNOPS | www.unops.org Keep up-to-date with UNOPS. Follow us on Facebook, LinkedIn, Twitter, Instagram, and YouTube. Subscribe to our external newsletter in English, French or Spanish.",
