                        Subject = "Email: DG ECHO Humanitarian Implementation Plan for Southern Africa and Indian Ocean 2025",
                        Description = "To: rainerf@unops.org; tatianaw@unops.org; fumiea@unops.org; entelas@unops.org\nCC: mariacarmenco@unops.org; laetitiak@unops.org\nBCC: \nAttachment: --none--\n\nSubject: DG ECHO Humanitarian Implementation Plan for Southern Africa and Indian Ocean 2025\nBody:\nDear colleagues, \nI am writing to inform you that DG ECHO has made available a new Humanitarian Implementation Plan (HIP) for the Southern Africa Indian Ocean Region for 2025.\nKindly find attached:The HIP identifying the priority areas of intervention;The Technical Annex containing the financial and operational information, as well as contact points. Please feel free to share internally and do not hesitate to reach out to us should you have any questions.\n\nKind regards,\nCelia\nCelia Keller Martínez (she/her) | Senior Partnerships and Communication Officer (OIC) | Partnerships and Liaison Group | Brussels Liaison Office | UNOPS | www.unops.org Keep up-to-date with UNOPS. Follow us on Facebook, LinkedIn, Twitter, Instagram, and YouTube. Subscribe to our external newsletter in English, French or Spanish.",
