                        Subject = "Email: Energising Health care through PPPP",
                        Description = "To: maierom@who.int; egorovaa@who.int\nCC: \nBCC: \nAttachment: --none--\n\nSubject: Energising Health care through PPPP\nBody:\nHi Marina and AlexandraGreat to \"see\" you on the ATACH today.  On COP 29 - can you please confirm that Maria Neira is available to Moderate our panel on 15th November at 9am at the WHO Pavilion?Many thanks for letting me know, so we can plan accordinglyBest wishes, Louise\nLouise Leech, MPH  | Head of Geneva Liaison Office | Partnerships and Liaison Group | Mobile: +41 79 343 1614  UNOPS / Office des Nations Unies pour les Services Unité de Gestion du Projet\nGlobal project overview here  |  Follow us on Facebook, LinkedIn, Twitter, Instagram, YouTube",
