                        Date = DateTime.Parse("2024-10-22").ToUniversalTime(),
                        Subject = "Email: Re: UNOPS/WHO",
                        Description = "To: kastnera@who.int\nCC: \nBCC: \nAttachment: --none--\n\nSubject: Re: UNOPS/WHO\nBody:\nOh wow! it has been 2 years (almost to the day!!) since we last communicated - apologies for my rubbish follow up!!  With my dear colleague Jean Vincent in town participating in your meeting, it prompted me to reach out again.I hope we might meet at Aidex if you are dropping by, otherwise perhaps we can have a coffee some time soon.\n\nI joined UNOPS in this new role, around 2.5 years ago, leaving WHO after many years in various locations.  Whilst I am no procurement expert :) my role is to strengthen the partnership between WHO and UNOPS at all levels. Over one third of our implementation is now in Health and we continue to support WHO and member states to accelerate initiatives to build resilient health infrastructure, sustainable procurement systems and strengthen project management around the world.\nLooking forward to connecting properly, when you schedule permits. I am often at WHO, so just let me know what works best for you.\nBest wishes Louise\nLouise Leech, MPH  | Head of Geneva Liaison Office | Partnerships and Liaison Group | Mobile: +41 79 343 1614  UNOPS / Office des Nations Unies pour les Services Unité de Gestion du Projet\nGlobal project overview here  |  Follow us on Facebook, LinkedIn, Twitter, Instagram, YouTube \n\nOn Wed, 19 Oct 2022 at 11:26, KASTNER, Angela <kastnera@who.int> wrote:\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nDear Louise, apologies for the late notification but I will not be able to meet today after all. Another meeting has come up that I need to attend.\nI met Anne Claire and some of your other UNOPS colleagues last week at the UN Procurement Network. If you have other topics we need to cover let me know and I will find a time to reschedule.\n \nKind regards\nAngela\n \n\n-----Original Appointment-----\n\nFrom: KASTNER, Angela \n\nSent: Wednesday 19 October 2022 11:15\n\nTo: Louise Jocelyn LEECH\n\nSubject: Canceled: UNOPS/WHO\n\nWhen: Wednesday 19 October 2022 14:00-14:30 (UTC+01:00) Belgrade, Bratislava, Budapest, Ljubljana, Prague.\n\nWhere: Microsoft Teams Meeting\n\nImportance: High\n\n \nAs per our emails Louise…look forward to talking to you on the 19th. Kind regards, Angela\n \n \n\n________________________________________________________________________________\n\n\n\n\nMicrosoft Teams meeting\n\n\n\n\nJoin on your computer, mobile app or room device\n\n\nClick\n here to join the meeting \n\n\n\nMeeting ID:\n344 122 604 301\n\n\nPasscode:\nUueouR\n\n\nDownload Teams |\n\nJoin on the web\n\n\n\n\nJoin with a video conferencing device\n\n\n\nwho2@m.webex.com\n\n\n\nVideo Conference ID:\n126 131 704 2\n\n\n\nAlternate VTC instructions\n\n\n\nLearn More |\n\nMeeting options \n\n\n\n________________________________________________________________________________",
