                        Date = DateTime.Parse("2025-05-13").ToUniversalTime(),
                        Subject = "Email: Re: Favour to ask",
                        Description = "To: vaszal@um.dk\nCC: \nBCC: \nAttachment: --none--\n\nSubject: Re: Favour to ask\nBody:\nSure Vasyl, and I will add Valentyn Povroznuyk from partnerships and our HoP Marysia just in case as well:Marysia Zapasnik - Head of Programme - marysiaz@unops.org, + 380 502918548Elene Agladze - UAMCO Partnerships Specialist - eleneag@unops.org, +380 956001880Arun Narayanan - Infrastructure Advisor - arunn@unops.org, +380 504750053Teresa Rodriguez - Senior Project Manager - teresam@unops.org, +380669645309    +34618939839Svitlana Zakrynytska - Deputy Project Manager - svitlanaz@unops.org. +380 95340 7859Valentyn Povroznyuk - Senior Partnerships Officer - valentynp@unops.org, +380 677548669Let me know if you need any other info.\nBest,Elene\nOn Tue, May 13, 2025 at 10:21 AM Vasyl Zalishchuk <vaszal@um.dk> wrote:\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nDear Elene,\n\n \nThank you for participating in the meeting. Could I please ask you to prepare short list with emails names and tel numbers of your team\n \nElene\nArun\nTeresa\nSvitlana\n\n \nThank you very much\n\n \nSincerely,\n\nVasyl\n \n_______________________________________________________\n \nVASYL ZALISHCHUK  /\nVASZAL@UM.DK\nUDVIKLINGSRÅDGIVER\nDIREKTE +380442001275 / MOBIL +380673069393\n \nEMBASSY OF DENMARK / UA-01901 KYIV 01\nTLF. 380 44 200 1260 /\nUKRAINE.UM.DK\n \nSÅDAN\n BEHANDLER VI PERSONOPLYSNINGER",
                        Location = null,
                        GmailThreadId = null,
                        GmailMessageId = "00TQx00000P84BOMAZ",
