                new (
                    "00TQx00000OGWUPMA5",
                    new UNOPSInteraction
                    {
                        Name = "Email: Re: General Specifications Files ( Medical Equipment's for Izyum Hospital )",
                        Type = InteractionType.Email,
                        Date = DateTime.Parse("2025-04-15").ToUniversalTime(),
                        Subject = "Email: Re: General Specifications Files ( Medical Equipment's for Izyum Hospital )",
                        Description = "To: m.alrowaily@ksrelief.org\nCC: a.h.alghamdi@ksrelief.org; h.alahmadi@ksrelief.org; f.alshamari@ksrelief.org; eleneag@unops.org\nBCC: \nAttachment: --none--\n\nSubject: Re: General Specifications Files ( Medical Equipment's for Izyum Hospital )\nBody:\nDear Moteb,\nIt was a real pleasure meeting you as well. \nThanks for sharing this information. I am copying my colleague Elene, Partnerships Specialist at our Ukraine Multi-Country Office who will work on developing the proposal with the team taking into account the below information. \nWe thank you for this opportunity and look forward to a strong collaboration between UNOPS and KSrelief. \nBestHala \n\nHala Al-Sharifi | Head of the Gulf Countries Liaison Office | Partnerships and Liaison Group (PLG) | Amman, Jordan | Tel: +962 6 590 2158 | Mob: +962 79 900 8544 | Follow us on social media and subscribe to our newsletter. | www.unops.org\n\nOn Tue, Apr 15, 2025 at 12:09 PM Moteb Alrowaily <m.alrowaily@ksrelief.org> wrote:\nDear Hala\n\nI hope this email finds you well.\n\nThank you for answering our call in such a short notice, I certainly believe that this project will have a major success with a great impact.\n\nHere are the general specifications regarding the medical equipment list.\n\n1- Specifications File - including technical specifications and brief configurations for the listed equipment, but with the exception of the following X-ray systems:\n\n\n\n- Stationary Digital X-ray Diagnostic System - Philips CombiDiagnost R90 with Ambient Experience (3-year warranty, listed as Item No. 3 in the general table):\n\n\n\n- Mobile Digital X-ray Diagnostic System - Philips Mobile Diagnostic wDR in the Performance Plus configuration (3-year warranty, listed as Item No. 5 in the general table).\n\n\n\n2- Specifications file for Non-Philips Medical Equipment\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nPlease note that we do not have specific brand preferences overall, any equipment marked as Philips in the specifications should be Philips-branded.\n\nkindly share the detailed proposal with the needs assessment from your side along with the budget details and allocation (overall Cost, price per unit,) M&E plan + Visibility.\n\n\n\nIt's been pleasure meeting you Hala, Waiting to hear from you again.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nSincerely,\n\n\n\nMoteb S,Alrowaily\n\nEmergency Medicine & Health Aid Specialist\n\n\n\nHealth & Environmental Aid Dept.\n\nKing Salman Humanitarian Aid & Relief Centre\n\nKingdom of Saudi Arabia\n\nT  + 966  11 207  2901\n\nExt   4397\n\nE    m.alrowaily@ksrelief.org<mailto:m.alrowaily@ksrelief.org>\n\n\n\n[?????: cid:image005.png@01D09D12.F9FD3EC0]\n\n\n\n[?????: cid:image006.png@01D09D12.F9FD3EC0]\n\n\n\nThis e-mail and any file(s) transmitted with it, is property of King Salman Humanitarian Aid & Relief Centre. This e-mail may contain confidential information and/or information protected by intellectual property rights or other rights. If you are not the intended recipient of this e-mail, you are hereby notified that any unauthorized use, dissemination, distribution, copying, or action taken in relation to the contents of and attachments to this e-mail is strictly prohibited and may be unlawful. If you have received this e-mail in error, please notify the sender and delete the original and any copies of this e-mail and any printouts immediately from your system and destroy all copies of it. Thank you for your cooperation.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nDisclaimer:This message and any attachments included in contains very up close and confidential information, therefore, the receiver shall deal and act with this message shall be treated and subject to confidentiality and non-disclosure, and is intended only for the individual named. If you are not the named addressee you should not disseminate, publish, distribute, re-send to any third Party or copy this e-mail. In Such case, please notify the sender immediately by e-mail if you have received this e-mail by mistake and delete this e-mail from your system permanently. Also. E-mail transmission cannot be guaranteed to be secured or error-free as information could be intercepted, corrupted, lost, destroyed, arrive late or incomplete, or contain viruses, which depend in dealing with on the receiver's operating system and firewalls in active.\n\n\n\n????? ???????:? ????? ??? ??????? ????? ??????? ??????? ??? ??????? ?????? ???? ????? ????? ??????? ???????? ????????? ??? ???? ?? ???? ??????? ???? ??? ??????? ????? ???????? ?? ??? ??????? ???????? ??????? ??? ????? ?????? ???? ???????? ??? ?? ??????? ?? ?? ??????? ?????? ?????? ??????? ?????? ???? ??? ?????? ??? ?????? ????? ????????? ??? ???? ??????? ??????? ?????????? ??????? ?? ???? ????? ?? ?? ??? ??? ????? ??????? ???? ???? ?? ??? ???? ??????? ??? ??????? ?? ???? ?? ?????? ?? ?????? ?? ????? ?????? ?????? ????? ???? ?? ??? ?????? ????? ?????? ?????? ??? ???????? ?????? ????? ?????? ???? ????? ??? ??? ??? ??????? ?? ????? ??????? ????? ????? ??????? ?? ???? ???? ?? ???? ????? ?????? ?????????? ???? ?? ???????? ?? ???? ??? ?????? ?? ?????? ?????????? ?? ?????? ?????? ?? ???????? ??? ?? ??? ??????? ?????? ?????????? ?? ??? ????? ?? ????? ??? ?????? ?? ?????? ???? ?? ????? ??? ??????? ????????? ????? ??????? ???? ??? ????? ??????? ?????? ??????? ??????? ??? ????????.\n\nAny un authorized publishing, miss using or disclosing without the Centre's prior written consent shall entitle the Centre's rights for compensations and claims to cover all damages or losses incurred to the limit permitted by applicable laws of KSA.\n\n\n\n? ?? ??? ?? ???? ??????? ?? ????? ?? ?? ?? ??????? ??? ??????? ???? ?????? ?????? ???????? ??????? ???? ?????? ???? ?? ??? ????????? ??????? ?? ???? ??????? ?? ??????? ???????? ?? ???? ??? ?????? ??? ???? ?? ???????? ????? ????? ?? ???????.\n\nThis communication doesn't constitute any binding commitment on behalf of KSRELIEF (The Centre), and is subject to contract and a final approval in accordance with the Centre's int