                        Subject = "Email: RE: Strengthening the Health Systems in Mykolaiv: Procurement, Kick-off meeting",
                        Description = "To: serbab@um.dk; IRYD@novonordisk.com; svitlanas@unops.org; jakhas@um.dk\nCC: vaszal@um.dk; eleneag@unops.org; vadyms@unops.org\nBCC: \nAttachment: --none--\n\nSubject: RE: Strengthening the Health Systems in Mykolaiv: Procurement, Kick-off meeting\nBody:\nDear Iryna\n \nThank you. I am unfortunately not available on the suggested time as next week is Easter holiday. I will be back on Tuesday 22nd\n April and available to meet that week. \n \nKind regards\nSune\n \n\n\nFrom: Serhii Babkin <serbab@um.dk>\n\n\nSent: 09 April 2025 09:50\n\nTo: IRYD (Iryna Donets) <IRYD@novonordisk.com>; svitlanas@unops.org; Jakob Torrild Hansen <jakhas@um.dk>\n\nCc: Sune Hjelmervik Gudnitz <sungud@um.dk>; Elene AGLADZE <eleneag@unops.org>; Vasyl Zalishchuk <vaszal@um.dk>; Vadym SHCHEDRIN <vadyms@unops.org>\n\nSubject: RE: Strengthening the Health Systems in Mykolaiv: Procurement, Kick-off meeting\n\n\n \nIryna,\nGood Morning!\n \nSuggested time is ok. Thanks in advance.\n\n \nMed venlig hilsen\n__________________________________________________\nSERHII BABKIN /\nSERBAB@UM.DK\nCOOPERATION ADVISOR – MYKOLAIV RECOVERY PROGRAMME\nTEL:\n+38 067 271 60 94\n/ WHATSAPP\n+380503372177\n\n \nROYAL DANISH EMBASSY IN KYIV – MYKOLAIV OFFICE\nLYAHINA 4/54001 MYKOLAIV, UKRAINE\nTEL: +38 044 200 12 60 /\nhttps://ukraine.um.dk/\n\n\nHOW\n WE HANDLE PERSONAL INFORMATION\n\n \n\n\nFrom: IRYD (Iryna Donets) <IRYD@novonordisk.com>\n\n\nSent: 08 April 2025 15:27\n\nTo: svitlanas@unops.org; Jakob Torrild Hansen <jakhas@um.dk>; Serhii Babkin <serbab@um.dk>\n\nCc: Sune Hjelmervik Gudnitz <sungud@um.dk>; Elene AGLADZE <eleneag@unops.org>; Vasyl Zalishchuk <vaszal@um.dk>; Vadym SHCHEDRIN <vadyms@unops.org>\n\nSubject: Strengthening the Health Systems in Mykolaiv: Procurement, Kick-off meeting\n\n\n \n[CAUTION - EXTERNAL EMAIL] This email was sent from outside the MFA organisation. DO NOT reply, click on links, or open attachments\n unless you have verified the sender and know the content is safe.\n\nDear partners,\n \nGiven the agreement signed by both parties on the Procurement component of “Strengthening the Health Systems in Mykolaiv” Project,\nI suggest setting up an online kick-off meeting to discuss the launch of equipment procurement process, as well as its alignment with the construction\n workplan, so everyone interested is on the same page. \n \nPlease let me know if next week, Tuesday 15\\04 from 11:00 to 12:00 is okay for you, or suggest another time.\n\n \nBest regards,\nIryna\n \n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nIryna Donets\n\n\n\n\n\nPublic Affairs Director\n\n\n\n\n\n40403 Public Affairs Department\n\n\n\n\n\niryd@novonordisk.com\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nNovo Nordisk Ukraine ǀ\n Limited Liability Company ǀ\n 13-15 Bolsunovska Street ǀ\n IQ Business Center 7th Floor ǀ  Kyiv, 01104 ǀ\n +38 044 389 4400 (switchboard) ǀ\n novonordisk.ua ǀ \n\nFacebook ǀ \n\nLinkedIn ǀ \n\nInstagram ǀ \n\nX (Twitter) ǀ \n\nYouTube ǀ \n\nTikTok \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nThis e-mail (including any attachments) is intended for the addressee(s) stated above only and may contain confidential information protected\n by law. You are hereby notified that any unauthorised reading, disclosure, copying or distribution of this e-mail or use of information contained herein is strictly prohibited and may violate rights to proprietary information. If you are not an intended recipient,\n please return this e-mail to the sender and delete it immediately hereafter. Thank you.",
