                        Subject = "Email: Re: UNOPS signatory",
                        Description = "To: uuni@novonordisk.com\nCC: \nBCC: \nAttachment: --none--\n\nSubject: Re: UNOPS signatory\nBody:\nDear Ulrik,\nJust to confirm that we have received the countersigned agreement and the engagement has been launched.\nThank you for your support.\nAll the Best,Elene\nOn Tue, Apr 1, 2025 at 8:32 PM Elene AGLADZE <eleneag@unops.org> wrote:\nDear Ulrik,\nIndeed, our RD has received the agreement and enclosed is the signed copy. We look forward to the countersigned agreement.\nThank you and all the best,Elene \nOn Tue, Apr 1, 2025, 17:54 UUNI (Ulrik Uldall Nielsen) <uuni@novonordisk.com> wrote:\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nDear Elene\n \nI have just sent the agreement for signature in DocuSign to Tim Lardner.\n\n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nKind regards\n\n\n\n\n\nUlrik Uldall Nielsen\n\n\n\n\n\nAdvocacy\n&\nPartnership Lead\n\n\n\n\n\n41005551 Advocacy and Partnerships\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nNovo Nordisk A/S ǀ \n+45-30754738 (mobile) ǀ \nuuni@novonordisk.com \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n\nFrom: Elene AGLADZE <eleneag@unops.org>\n\n\nSent: 28. marts 2025 08:46\n\nTo: UUNI (Ulrik Uldall Nielsen) <uuni@novonordisk.com>\n\nSubject: Re: UNOPS signatory\n\n\n \n\nCaution: This email is from outside Novo Nordisk's system. Think before clicking links or opening attachments. Use\n PhishAlarm to report suspicious emails. \n\n \n\n\nDear Ulrik, \n\n \n\n\nI hope all is well.\n\n\n \n\n\nJust wanted to say that our RD has not received the Agreement for signing yet and thought to check - do you think we could complete the signature today?\n\n\n \n\n\nKind regards,\n\n\nElene\n\n\n \n\n\nOn Tue, Mar 25, 2025 at 9:30 AM Elene AGLADZE <eleneag@unops.org> wrote:\n\n\n\n\nDear Ulrik,\n\n\n \n\n\nAbsolutely, I will email our RD later in the afternoon today to alert about the signing tomorrow.\n\n\n \n\n\nMany thanks,\n\n\nElene\n\n \n\n\nOn Tue, Mar 25, 2025, 08:28 UUNI (Ulrik Uldall Nielsen) <uuni@novonordisk.com> wrote:\n\n\n\n\n\nDear Elene \n\n\nWe are now ready to sign the contract which I will initiate tomorrow.\n\n\n \n\n\nLet me know if this is okay with you. \n\n\n \n\n\nKind regards \n\n\nUlrik\n\n\n \n\n\n\n \n\n\nSent from Outlook for iOS\n\n\n\n\n\nFrom: Elene AGLADZE <eleneag@unops.org>\n\nSent: Thursday, March 20, 2025 5:09:00 PM\n\nTo: UUNI (Ulrik Uldall Nielsen) <uuni@novonordisk.com>\n\nSubject: Re: UNOPS signatory \n\n \n\n\n\n\nCaution: This email is from outside Novo Nordisk's system. Think before clicking links or opening attachments. Use\n PhishAlarm to report suspicious emails. \n\n \n\n\nAgreed - will wait for your note\n\n \n\n\nOn Thu, Mar 20, 2025 at 5:08 PM UUNI (Ulrik Uldall Nielsen) <uuni@novonordisk.com> wrote:\n\n\n\n\n\nMakes good sense. I will notify you if is made tomorrow but not sure\n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nKind regards\n\n\n\n\n\nUlrik Uldall Nielsen\n\n\n\n\n\nAdvocacy & Partnership Lead\n\n\n\n\n\n41005551 Advocacy and Partnerships\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nNovo Nordisk A/S ǀ  +45-30754738 (mobile) ǀ \nuuni@novonordisk.com \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n\nFrom: Elene AGLADZE <eleneag@unops.org>\n\n\nSent: 20. marts 2025 16:06\n\nTo: UUNI (Ulrik Uldall Nielsen) <uuni@novonordisk.com>\n\nSubject: Re: UNOPS signatory\n\n\n \n\nCaution: This email is from outside Novo Nordisk's system. Think before clicking links or opening attachments. Use PhishAlarm to report\n suspicious emails. \n\n \n\n\n\nDear Ulrik,\n\n\n \n\n\nOf course - If you think we can have the signing tomorrow, I can inform RD that he should expect the signing sometime tomorrow and in the meantime we will align everything in the system. I just think it's good for us to know at least the day to avoid confusion.\n\n\n \n\n\nAll the Best,\n\n\nElene\n\n\n \n\n \n\n\nOn Thu, Mar 20, 2025 at 4:59 PM UUNI (Ulrik Uldall Nielsen) <uuni@novonordisk.com> wrote:\n\n\n\n\n\nDear Elene\n \nThat makes sense. I am not ready to send if off for signing yet due to internal alignment as well. But preparing everything as I will be travelling next week.\n\n \nI will definitely let you know when I am ready. How much time in advance do you need?\n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nKind regards\n\n\n\n\n\nUlrik Uldall Nielsen\n\n\n\n\n\nAdvocacy & Partnership Lead\n\n\n\n\n\n41005551 Advocacy and Partnerships\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nNovo Nordisk A/S ǀ  +45-30754738 (mobile) ǀ \nuuni@novonordisk.com \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n\nFrom: Elene AGLADZE <eleneag@unops.org>\n\n\nSent: 20. marts 2025 15:39\n\nTo: UUNI (Ulrik Uldall Nielsen) <uuni@novonordisk.com>\n\nSubject: Re: UNOPS signatory\n\n\n \n\nCaution: This email is from outside Novo Nordisk's system. Think before clicking links or opening attachments. Use PhishAlarm to report\n suspicious emails. \n\n \n\n\n\nDear Ulrik, \n\n \n\n\nOf course, Tim Lardner's email address is \ntiml@unops.org.\n\n\n \n\n\nOn the actual signing - usually I send the project and agreement details to the Regional Director and update our internal system with the signing date to make sure all details are aligned. So, just wanted to check if you will be sending the document for\n signing directly to RD and when. If so, I would need to alert him and get the system ready for that date.\n\n\n \n\n\nMany thanks and kind regards,\n\n\nElene\n\n\n \n\n\n\n\nOn Thu, Mar 20, 2025 at 4:12 PM UUNI (Ulrik Uldall Nielsen) <uuni@novonordisk.com> wrote:\n\n\n\n\n\nDear Elene\n\n \nCan you provide me with mail address for Tim Lardner which I need for the signing of the agreement in DocuSign?\n\n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nKind regards\n\n\n\n\n\nUlrik Uldall Nielsen\n\n\n\n\n\nAdvocacy & Partnership Lead\n\n\n\n\n\n41005551 Advocacy and Partnerships\n\n\n\n\n\n+45-30754738 (mobile)\n\n\n\n\n\nuuni@novonordisk.com\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nNovo Nordisk A/S ǀ\n Krogshøjvej 46 ǀ\n DK-2880 Bagsværd ǀ\n +45 4444 8888 (switchboard) ǀ\n novonordisk.com ǀ \nFacebook ǀ \nLinkedIn ǀ \nInstagram ǀ \nX (Twitter) ǀ \nYouTube ǀ \nTikTok\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n\n\n\nThis e-mail (including any attachments) is intended for the addressee(s) stated above only and may contain confidential information protected by law. You are hereby notified\n that any unauthorised reading, disclosure, copying or distribution of this e-mail or use of information contained herein is strictly prohibited and may violate rights to proprietary information. If you are not an intended recipient, please return this e-mail\n to the sender and delete it immediately hereafter. Thank you.",
