                        Subject = "Email: Re: Integrity assessment for MOTE // Need your assistance",
                        Description = "To: serbab@um.dk\nCC: artvas@um.dk; jakhas@um.dk; marysiaz@unops.org; marthaas@unops.org; svitlanas@unops.org\nBCC: \nAttachment: --none--\n\nSubject: Re: Integrity assessment for MOTE // Need your assistance\nBody:\nDear Serhii,\nThank you for reaching out. Since I am not in charge of direct implementation, let me add our Head of Programme, PM and PMO to this email, I trust they will be able to respond.\nWith thanks and kind regards,Elene\nOn Wed, Apr 2, 2025 at 9:18 AM Serhii Babkin <serbab@um.dk> wrote:\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nElene,\nGood Morning!\n \nPlease note that as part of future improvement procedure for city municipal enterprises, MOTE is passing Integrity assessment conducted by EUACI. On the present stage they\n require feedback from international partners on the short questionnaire.\n \nNeed your assistance on this indicating relevant POC to support them with the activity as UNOPS conducted procurements in cooperation with them.\n \nOfficial letter is attached but it’s in Ukrainian.\n \nThanks in advance!\n \nMed venlig hilsen\n__________________________________________________\nSERHII BABKIN /\nSERBAB@UM.DK\nCOOPERATION ADVISOR – MYKOLAIV RECOVERY PROGRAMME\nTEL:\n+38 067 271 60 94\n/ WHATSAPP\n+380503372177\n\n \nROYAL DANISH EMBASSY IN KYIV – MYKOLAIV OFFICE\nLYAHINA 4/54001 MYKOLAIV, UKRAINE\nTEL: +38 044 200 12 60 /\nhttps://ukraine.um.dk/\n\n\nHOW\n WE HANDLE PERSONAL INFORMATION",
                        Location = null,
                        GmailThreadId = null,
                        GmailMessageId = "00TQx00000NTluLMAT",
                        EmailAddresses = new List<string> { "serbab@um.dk", "svitlanas@unops.org", "marysiaz@unops.org", "jakhas@um.dk", "artvas@um.dk", "marthaas@unops.org" },
