                    {
                        Name = "Email: RE: Making Contact | UNOPS Communication in the Caribbean | Guyana",
                        Type = InteractionType.Email,
                        Date = DateTime.Parse("2025-05-30").ToUniversalTime(),
                        Subject = "Email: RE: Making Contact | UNOPS Communication in the Caribbean | Guyana",
                        Description = "To: sofiatr@unops.org; williamsg@unops.org\nCC: antoinel@unops.org; giuseppem@unops.org\nBCC: \nAttachment: --none--\n\nSubject: RE: Making Contact | UNOPS Communication in the Caribbean | Guyana\nBody:\nDear Sofia,\nMy sincerest apologies for this very delayed response.\n \nIt is my pleasure to connect with you. In Guyana, we have an inter-agency communications group. Would you like to be added to that mailing list? We meet monthly or bi-monthly as needed. We also have an active Whatsapp group where we keep\n in greater contact.\n \nKind regards,\nColette\n \n\n\nFrom: Sofia TREJOS <sofiatr@unops.org>\n\n\nSent: Wednesday, March 12, 2025 5:49 PM\n\nTo: William Squier Gonzales [UNOPS] <williamsg@unops.org>; Colette Hytmiah-Singh <colette.hytmiah-singh@un.org>\n\nCc: Antoine Lust [UNOPS] <antoinel@unops.org>; Giuseppe Mancinelli [UNOPS] <giuseppem@unops.org>\n\nSubject: Re: Making Contact | UNOPS Communication in the Caribbean | Guyana\n\n\n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nYou don't often get email from sofiatr@unops.org.\nLearn why this is important\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nDear William, \nThanks for your message and for introducing me to Colette.\n \nColette, it's a pleasure to meet you! I look forward to collaborating with you and appreciate your support in communication-related matters for UNOPS in Guyana.\n Please do not hesitate to reach out if there is anything I can assist with as well.\n \nRegards! \n \n\n \n\n\nOn Mon, Mar 10, 2025 at 9:39 AM William SQUIER GONZALEZ <williamsg@unops.org> wrote:\n\n\n\n\nDear Sofía,\n\n\n \n\n\nAs we strive towards strengthening our operations towards the Caribbean parts of the portfolio, I am pleased to introduce you to Colette, who will be our communication focal point for the UN system in Guyana.\n\n\n\n \n\n\nColette will be your main point of contact for all communication-related matters concerning the UNOPS' work in Guyana. She can support and coordinate in relation to any inquiries you may have and to keep you updated on UN activities.\n\n\n \n\n\nPlease feel free to reach out to Colette directly with any questions or requests.\n\n\n \n\n\nBest regards and a very pleasant week ahead.\n\n\n \n\n\n\n\n\nWilliam SQUIER GONZALEZ\n\nHead of Programme | ICMCO | LCR\n\nSan Jose, Costa Rica | Tel: +506 8337 9154\n\n\n\nFollow us on social media and\nsubscribe to our newsletter. |\nwww.unops.org\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n-- \n\n\n\nSofía Trejos Lépiz (she/her) | Oficial Senior de Comunicaciones | LCR | PAMCO | San\n José,  (Costa Rica) | Tel.: +506 4081 0040 | Mobile: (WhatsApp): +506 8704 2199 |\nSíganos\n en las redes sociales y suscríbase\n a nuestro boletín informativo | www.unops.org/es\n |\nwww.proyectoscostarica.org",
