                        Subject = "Email: RE: Signature of PIA for Barbados",
                        Description = "To: antoinel@unops.org; r.musi@eib.org\nCC: e.lopez@eib.org; a.kumancinar@eib.org; giuseppem@unops.org; williamsg@unops.org; laetitiak@unops.org; t.gurdal@eib.org; k.eisele@eib.org; j.davia@eib.org\nBCC: \nAttachment: --none--\n\nSubject: RE: Signature of PIA for Barbados\nBody:\nCorporate Use\n\n\n\n\n\n\nDear Antoine,\n \nThank you for sending the signed PIA.\n\n \nOur colleague, Ayca, is coordinating a meeting, so that we can discuss with you about the next steps.\n \nBest regards,\n \nAstrid Thome\n\nSenior Portfolio Management Officer – Counterparty Management Non EU\n\nPortfolio Management and Monitoring Department\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n98-100 boulevard Konrad Adenauer\n\nL-2950 Luxembourg\n\n+352 4379-85729 (office)\n\n+352 691 287 590 (mobile)\nwww.eib.org\n\n\n\n\n \n \n \n\nFrom: Antoine LUST <antoinel@unops.org>\n\n\nSent: Thursday 22 May 2025 18:34\n\nTo: MUSI Roberto <r.musi@eib.org>\n\nCc: GURDAL Tunc <t.gurdal@eib.org>; THOME Astrid <astrid.thome@eib.org>; EISELE Kristina <k.eisele@eib.org>; DAVIÀ Jasmin <j.davia@eib.org>; LOPEZ Emmanuel <e.lopez@eib.org>; KUMAN CINAR Ayca <a.kumancinar@eib.org>; Giuseppe MANCINELLI <giuseppem@unops.org>;\n William SQUIER GONZALEZ <williamsg@unops.org>; Laetitia KRAUS <laetitiak@unops.org>\n\nSubject: Re: Signature of PIA for Barbados\n\n \n\nDear Roberto and team,\n\n \n\n\nIt's a pleasure to salute you. \n\n\n \n\n\nPlease find attached the PIA signed on our side. We are looking forward to liaising for the next steps. \n\n\n \n\n\nWarm regards, \n\n\n \n\n\nAntoine\n\n\n \n\n\nOn Tue, May 13, 2025 at 10:59 AM MUSI Roberto <r.musi@eib.org> wrote:\n\n\n\n\nCorporate Use\n \n\n\nHallo Antoine,\nThank you\nNo changes were done from our side, it is the last version shared from you based on our technical discussions during the end of 2024.\nIn case of any other point on hold let us know\nBest regards\nRoberto\n \n\nFrom: Antoine\n LUST <antoinel@unops.org>\n\n\nSent: Tuesday 13 May 2025 17:07\n\nTo: MUSI Roberto <r.musi@eib.org>\n\nCc: GURDAL Tunc <t.gurdal@eib.org>; THOME Astrid <astrid.thome@eib.org>; EISELE Kristina <k.eisele@eib.org>;\n DAVIÀ Jasmin <j.davia@eib.org>; LOPEZ Emmanuel <e.lopez@eib.org>; KUMAN CINAR Ayca <a.kumancinar@eib.org>;\n Giuseppe MANCINELLI <giuseppem@unops.org>; William SQUIER GONZALEZ <williamsg@unops.org>\n\nSubject: Re: Signature of PIA for Barbados\n\n \n\n\nHi Roberto,\n\n\n\nThank you for sharing the signed PIA. We will therefore proceed with our internal processes. \n\n\n\nCould you indicate whether any changes have been made?\n\n\n \n\n\nBest,\n\nAntoine\n\n\nOn Mon, May 12, 2025, 04:05 MUSI Roberto <r.musi@eib.org> wrote:\n\n\n\nCorporate Use\n \n\n\n \nDear Antoine,\nHope all is good.\nPlease find attached the signed PIA from EIB services involved.\nApologies again for this delay. I anticipate it from the technical side for your follow up within UNOPS.\nAs for the formal next steps, the colleagues in copy from the local representation in Barbados and liaison office in Washington will keep in contact with you.\nThank you\nBest regards\nRoberto\n \n \n\n\n--------------------------------------------------------------------\nLes informations contenues dans ce message et/ou ses annexes sont \n\nreservees a l'attention et a l'utilisation de leur destinataire et peuvent etre \n\nconfidentielles. Si vous n'etes pas destinataire de ce message, vous etes \n\ninformes que vous l'avez recu par erreur et que toute utilisation en est \n\ninterdite. Dans ce cas, vous etes pries de le detruire et d'en informer la \n\nBanque Europeenne d'Investissement.\nThe information in this message and/or attachments is intended solely for \n\nthe attention and use of the named addressee and may be confidential. If \n\nyou are not the intended recipient, you are hereby notified that you have \n\nreceived this transmittal in error and that any use of it is prohibited. In \n\nsuch a case please delete this message and kindly notify the European \n\nInvestment Bank accordingly.\n\n--------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n--------------------------------------------------------------------\nLes informations contenues dans ce message et/ou ses annexes sont \n\nreservees a l'attention et a l'utilisation de leur destinataire et peuvent etre \n\nconfidentielles. Si vous n'etes pas destinataire de ce message, vous etes \n\ninformes que vous l'avez recu par erreur et que toute utilisation en est \n\ninterdite. Dans ce cas, vous etes pries de le detruire et d'en informer la \n\nBanque Europeenne d'Investissement.\nThe information in this message and/or attachments is intended solely for \n\nthe attention and use of the named addressee and may be confidential. If \n\nyou are not the intended recipient, you are hereby notified that you have \n\nreceived this transmittal in error and that any use of it is prohibited. In \n\nsuch a case please delete this message and kindly notify the European \n\nInvestment Bank accordingly.\n\n--------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n\n\n\n\n\n--------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nLes informations contenues dans ce message et/ou ses annexes sont \n\nreservees a l'attention et a l'utilisation de leur destinataire et peuvent etre \n\nconfidentielles. Si vous n'etes pas destinataire de ce message, vous etes \n\ninformes que vous l'avez recu par erreur et que toute utilisation en est \n\ninterdite. Dans ce cas, vous etes pries de le detruire et d'en informer la \n\nBanque Europeenne d'Investissement.\n\nThe information in this message and/or attachments is intended solely for \n\nthe attention and use of the named addressee and may be confidential. If \n\nyou are not the intended recipient, you are hereby notified that you have \n\nreceived this transmittal in error and that any use of it is prohibited. In \n\nsuch a case please delete this message and kindly notify the Europea